WEBVTT

asr-000001
00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:21.650
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Next to interpellate is Representative Karl Legazpi from the majority.

asr-000002
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:28.970
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Good afternoon po, Mr. Secretary, and to the department and to its attached agencies.

asr-000003
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:34.950
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Ang amin pong mga katanungan ay nakasentro po sa lalawigan ng Palawan.

asr-000004
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:40.750
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Dahil po taga-doon po ako at ang amin pong constituencies ay galing po sa Palawan.

asr-000005
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:48.630
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: So mostly po, just a request on the updates on the development and progress of the active projects there.

asr-000006
00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:59.150
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: And yung pinaka-primary na issue na nilapit po sa aming tanggapan eh yung RoRo Port ng San Fernando sa El Nido, sa Palawan.

asr-000007
00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:08.810
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: I would just like to get an update po, probably from the PPA, if you have a timeline po on what we can expect from the development.

asr-000008
00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:11.890
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Kasi po yung port, I believe, was already finished.

asr-000009
00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.090
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Kailangan na lang ng additional development and additional construction po ng mga infrastructure doon.

asr-000010
00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:22.930
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: So may we get po an update from the PPA?

asr-000011
00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:27.170
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Thank you po, Your Honor. With the permission of the Secretary po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000012
00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:31.730
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yun pong port natin sa San Fernando, El Nido.

asr-000013
00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:36.290
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Currently po, there is a pending request from the provincial government of Palawan

asr-000014
00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:38.790
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: na i-devolve po sa kanila yung operation

asr-000015
00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:44.810
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: yung operation ng San Fernando Port, El Nido, together with the Borac Port po in Coron.

asr-000016
00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:48.930
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So we are working on the documentation po for the turnover of those two ports

asr-000017
00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:53.330
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: to be managed and operated by the provincial government po ng Palawan.

asr-000018
00:01:53.450 --> 00:02:00.550
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Kaya from PPA's end po, pending that turnover, we will not be scheduling any development po.

asr-000019
00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:06.290
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So ang development po noon will now be on the part of the provincial government.

asr-000020
00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:07.930
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sir.

asr-000021
00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:13.610
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Wala pong additional support na, sir, from the PPA?

asr-000022
00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:17.430
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Sa ngayon po kasi, Mr. Chair, if we put on the development,

asr-000023
00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.930
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: we will not be able to devolve that to the provincial government.

asr-000024
00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:24.850
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: I think yung request kasi ng provincial government is with urgency also

asr-000025
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.490
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: that they want to operate both ports po.

asr-000026
00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.610
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So nandoon po tayo ngayon sa sitwasyon na iyon.

asr-000027
00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:33.310
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So ang commitment naman po ng provincial government is that

asr-000028
00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:37.970
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: whatever development that is needed, particularly po sa San Fernando,

asr-000029
00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:41.250
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: is a passenger terminal building.

asr-000030
00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:43.290
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So sila daw po ang magpapagawa noon.

asr-000031
00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:50.070
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Kasi alam po natin yung impact sa local economy, it will really open up.

asr-000032
00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:56.090
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: And I know po it is through your efforts din po, GM, na in the past years,

asr-000033
00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.130
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: you were able to get it done.

asr-000034
00:02:58.130 --> 00:03:04.130
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: And hopefully po, we all wish that it would continue sa development po ng facilities.

asr-000035
00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.330
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Regarding naman po sa Buliluyan Port, Southern Palawan naman,

asr-000036
00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:13.490
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: when you consider it a gateway to the southern part of the country,

asr-000037
00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:14.570
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: the BIMP-EAGA area po,

asr-000038
00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.610
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: may we get an update on the ongoing expansion

asr-000039
00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:22.970
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: and the long-term plan to develop it into an integrated port and terminal?

asr-000040
00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:26.730
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Mr. Chair, again po, with the permission of the Secretary,

asr-000041
00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:31.750
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Meron po tayong ongoing development po and expansion sa Buliluyan Port po sa Bataraza.

asr-000042
00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:38.770
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And primarily po kasi we are developing that in coordination

asr-000043
00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.130
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: with the provincial government and with the Philippine Coast Guard,

asr-000044
00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:47.510
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: dahil it is a very crucial staging area po for the PCG operations in the West Philippine Sea.

asr-000045
00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:54.270
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So we can commit po, Mr. Chair, that tuloy-tuloy po yung development po natin diyan sa Buliluyan.

asr-000046
00:03:54.270 --> 00:04:03.450
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And to add po, further down south, katatapos lang po natin doon po sa Balabac.

asr-000047
00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.730
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: We have completed RoRo pier po doon.

asr-000048
00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.270
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And we will be...

asr-000049
00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:11.790
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: programming po another RoRo facility

asr-000050
00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.550
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: sa Manga Island naman po dito down south.

asr-000051
00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.490
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And north po, Cong,

asr-000052
00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:18.750
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: para ma-update na din po kayo,

asr-000053
00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:22.610
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: meron po tayong naka-program for Cagayancillo.

asr-000054
00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.870
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: This is for next year.

asr-000055
00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:30.490
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: As well as, may ongoing po tayo din for now and then for next year din po sa Cuyo Island.

asr-000056
00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:32.590
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Thank you.

asr-000057
00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.150
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Marami po tayo sa Palawan.

asr-000058
00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:34.750
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Okay.

asr-000059
00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:37.930
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Hopefully, hoping for the best support po.

asr-000060
00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:44.710
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: And kami naman po, we also would want to express our support to the PPA po for continuing projects.

asr-000061
00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:45.230
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Thank you.

asr-000062
00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:45.910
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Thank you.

asr-000063
00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:48.850
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Next question po, for the airports naman,

asr-000064
