Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Regarding sa Sandoval Airport sa Taytay.

asr-000066
00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:57.730
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Kasi it's an initiative of the provincial government.

asr-000067
