asr-000074
00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:26.690
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: But yung sa Sandoval po,

asr-000075
00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:32.170
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: meron kayang provisions coming from CAAP or other agencies

asr-000076
00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:38.050
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: that could support and fast-track the construction of the airport?

asr-000077
00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:39.810
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000078
00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.810
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po kayo.

asr-000079
00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:45.810
