LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Ang...

asr-000353
00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:10.820
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Tapos may PhilCab pa po tayo, which is called PhilCab.

asr-000354
00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:15.400
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Yung malilit po, Madam Chair, around 7,600.

asr-000355
00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.400
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Tapos ang buses po natin...

asr-000356
00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.080
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Mas...

asr-000357
00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:25.040
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Wala lang po kaming record ngayon, nung modern.

asr-000358
00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:32.180
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: But our buses, provincial and city buses, around 23,000 to 24,000.

asr-000359
00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:41.760
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Ang UV Express po, same pa rin po.

asr-000360
00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:42.140
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Same.

asr-000361
00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.000
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: And minibus, mas bumaba.

asr-000362
00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:49.360
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Kasi naging full bus po yung iba, Madam Chair.

asr-000363
00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:50.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Naging full bus po?

asr-000364
00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:50.820
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Yes po.

asr-000365
00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:52.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lumaki siya?

asr-000366
00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.160
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: They upgraded.

asr-000367
00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:53.900
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: They upgraded.

asr-000368
00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.140
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: They upgraded their services, Madam Chair, in order to cater more passengers.

asr-000369
00:20:58.240 --> 00:20:59.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: How about modern PUJs po?

asr-000370
00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:08.760
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Modern PUJs po, nasa 13,516 po, Madam Chair.

asr-000371
00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:09.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 1,313?

asr-000372
00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:10.600
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-000373
00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:10.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay.

asr-000374
00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:17.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair, we would be requesting updated numbers po, if maari pong masamite sa committee.

asr-000375
00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:19.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

asr-000376
00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:20.480
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-000377
00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:21.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000378
00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:25.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But also, using publicly available data,

asr-000379
00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:32.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we also track kung ilan po yung units ng nagpapatakbo ng mass transportation system natin

asr-000380
00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:35.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: before modernization started a decade ago.

asr-000381
00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:36.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Next slide, please.

asr-000382
00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:40.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, this is from CIDS, UPCIDS.

asr-000383
00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:48.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: According to their data, there used to be 300,000 PUJ units operating.

asr-000384
00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:55.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And kung total PUJs operating as of August 2025 was 128,000 plus,

asr-000385
00:21:55.880 --> 00:22:03.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: minus po natin siya, around 171,000 PUJ units were lost due to modernization.

asr-000386
00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:08.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung mahigit 170,000 na na-phase out na PUJs,

asr-000387
00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:14.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: matumbas po niyan if you include yung, or if you count yung average passenger capacity of 20,

asr-000388
00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:18.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: halos 3.5 million na passenger capacity ang nawasak.

asr-000389
00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:24.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tapos using 10 daily trips, parang 5 round trips po yan, isa, dalawa, ganun.

asr-000390
00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:33.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: That's 34 million daily passenger capacity niyo nawala dahil sa na-phase out po na 170,000 PUJs.

asr-000391
00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:36.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, ang tanong ko po, Mr. Chair,

asr-000392
00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:45.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: napunan po ba ng PTMP itong kawalan ng daily passenger capacity nung tinulak na magkaroon ng modern jeepneys?

asr-000393
00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:51.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Na according to the data here also shown, na may average capacity niyo, sabihin na po natin 25 katao.

asr-000394
00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:54.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero dahil 12,000 units lang,

asr-000395
00:22:54.920 --> 00:23:04.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: as of 2025, or 200, or nearing 300,000 ang passenger capacity and 3 million daily passenger capacity yung naiambag.

asr-000396
00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:13.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, yun po ang tanong natin, Mr. Chair, napunan po ba yung nawalang 34 million daily passenger capacity ng PTMP?

asr-000397
00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:19.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, with your permission po, I'm quite sure po nasama yan sa ating pag-aaral sa PTMP,

asr-000398
00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:24.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: but I will defer po to ASEC Dioscoro Reyes po, yung in-charge po ngayon,

asr-000399
00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:25.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ng road and infra natin.

asr-000400
00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:35.570
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair.

asr-000401
00:23:36.370 --> 00:23:37.990
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Ma'am Renee, good afternoon.

asr-000402
00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:43.470
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Ma'am, yung po, ano, yung sinasabi natin nakakulangan ng sasakyan

asr-000403
00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:49.130
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: because of the continuing growth of private vehicle use.

asr-000404
00:23:51.310 --> 00:23:56.330
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair, may I request the resource person to speak closer to the mic? Thank you.

asr-000405
00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:59.970
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Yung po nga traffic congestion natin,

asr-000406
00:24:00.710 --> 00:24:02.030
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: yung mga naranasan natin,

asr-000407
00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:05.050
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: yung mga naranasan natin na paghihirap ng ating mga nanatanggap,

asr-000408
00:24:05.050 --> 00:24:09.670
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: ay because of the continuing growth of private vehicle use,

asr-000409
00:24:09.870 --> 00:24:13.530
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: further increasing pressure on limited road space,

asr-000410
00:24:14.190 --> 00:24:20.670
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: particularly where public transport is perceived as inconvenient, unreliable, inaccessible, or poorly integrated.

asr-000411
00:24:22.170 --> 00:24:30.090
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Therefore, traffic congestion cannot be addressed solely by increasing road capacity or contracting [unclear].

asr-000412
00:24:30.090 --> 00:24:31.190
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair,

asr-000413
00:24:32.050 --> 00:24:35.330
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: but the answer po pertains to traffic.

asr-000414
00:24:35.650 --> 00:24:38.890
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang question po natin is yung daily passenger capacity.

asr-000415
00:24:39.050 --> 00:24:40.670
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: In short po, given this data,

asr-000416
00:24:41.570 --> 00:24:47.530
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kumonti po yung units of mass transportation system na kayang mag-accommodate ng passengers.

asr-000417
00:24:48.370 --> 00:24:53.470
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sabihin natin, factor yung traffic sa public transit rating natin na mababa.

asr-000418
00:24:53.710 --> 00:24:55.050
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero isang bahagi lang po yun.

asr-000419
00:24:55.050 --> 00:25:01.650
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang isang bahagi din po is kumonti po talaga yung vehicles na according to the numbers of the ORTR mismo,

asr-000420
00:25:02.050 --> 00:25:06.430
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi po napunan yung natanggal na 170,000 PUJs.

asr-000421
00:25:06.850 --> 00:25:08.770
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, yan po ang tanong po natin.

asr-000422
00:25:08.890 --> 00:25:13.090
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Paano na po yung mass transportation system natin na ganitong natanggal,

asr-000423
00:25:13.470 --> 00:25:16.890
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and nakikita, at nararamdaman ng maamayan yung kahirapan?

asr-000424
00:25:17.150 --> 00:25:17.550
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair?

asr-000425
00:25:18.170 --> 00:25:20.250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may answer po.

asr-000426
00:25:20.770 --> 00:25:21.510
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po.

asr-000427
00:25:21.650 --> 00:25:24.010
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung ating modernization program kasi po,

asr-000428
00:25:24.010 --> 00:25:30.010
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang pangunahing layunin dyan is yung roadworthiness din po ng ating mga lumang PUVs.

asr-000429
00:25:31.170 --> 00:25:32.010
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito rin po ay isa.

asr-000430
00:25:32.050 --> 00:25:38.290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sa mga dahilan, kung sa tingin po natin, kumonti yung mga existing PUVs natin.

asr-000431
00:25:38.710 --> 00:25:43.950
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero yan po yung sinasabi natin, dapat magkaroon din tayo ng tamang route rationalization.

asr-000432
00:25:44.710 --> 00:25:52.890
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi, admittedly, inaayos pa yan ng DOTR, kasi po talaga naging problema ho yan ng ating PTMP.

asr-000433
00:25:52.890 --> 00:25:57.890
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun pa man, pilit namin pinupunuhan po yung pagkukulang ng per route.

asr-000434
00:25:58.810 --> 00:26:01.890
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ito'y magagawa lang namin kapag may tama kaming pakikipag-ugnayan

asr-000435
00:26:02.050 --> 00:26:02.710
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sa local

asr-000436
00:26:02.710 --> 00:26:03.670
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: government.

asr-000437
00:26:04.290 --> 00:26:07.550
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: For example po, sa tingin namin, noong last year po,

asr-000438
00:26:07.770 --> 00:26:11.650
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pinakita nyo pong letrato, I think that's a long Commonwealth Avenue.

asr-000439
00:26:12.390 --> 00:26:19.250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Noong tayo po yung mismong nag-commute, nakita natin na kulang nga yung mga PUVs dyan.

asr-000440
00:26:19.250 --> 00:26:23.210
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kaya nagsabi tayo sa LTFRB na kailangan nyo magdagdag.

asr-000441
00:26:23.330 --> 00:26:25.870
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailangan nyo ayusin yung ating mga ruta.

asr-000442
00:26:26.390 --> 00:26:32.030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At para mas mabigyan natin ng tamang number of units na babaybay sa isang.

asr-000443
00:26:32.050 --> 00:26:42.110
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So the answer for this decrease of the number is not basically po nawalan sila ng sasakyan.

asr-000444
00:26:42.250 --> 00:26:44.650
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: More of nag-modernize po yung iba.

asr-000445
00:26:45.190 --> 00:26:48.930
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May route rationalization na po kung anong talagang number of units na tama

asr-000446
00:26:48.930 --> 00:26:51.050
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at number of authorized units na bumabaybay.

asr-000447
00:26:51.830 --> 00:26:58.490
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At pangatlo po yung mga natanggal po natin na mga hindi na po roadworthy na mga lumang PUVs po.

asr-000448
00:26:59.490 --> 00:27:01.490
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair, my next question po.

asr-000449
00:27:02.050 --> 00:27:02.890
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mag-next slide.

