asr-000459
00:27:44.490 --> 00:27:51.050
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: For example, 2018 up to 2019 dahil meron nga po 2 years na essential shelf life yung budget.

asr-000460
00:27:51.470 --> 00:27:54.450
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po bang makahingi ng explanation from DOTR on this?

asr-000461
00:27:54.970 --> 00:27:56.610
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Cong. Renee, please wrap up your question.

asr-000462
00:27:56.770 --> 00:27:57.830
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: One final manifestation.

asr-000463
00:27:57.830 --> 00:27:58.330
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

asr-000464
00:27:58.370 --> 00:28:01.830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chairman, sisimulan ko po dun sa 2025 po.

asr-000465
00:28:02.050 --> 00:28:05.090
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung saan po tayo pumasok ulit sa DOTR.

asr-000466
00:28:05.590 --> 00:28:09.050
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po kayo yung sinasabi natin na sa tingin natin unobligated.

asr-000467
00:28:09.830 --> 00:28:18.090
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think that's the number or the data that is as of May or June of this year.

asr-000468
