DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nang the DOTR together with the LTFRB, pati yung PTMP po namin na sektor,

asr-000472
00:28:36.810 --> 00:28:40.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: we pivoted po dun sa sinasabi nating equity subsidy.

asr-000473
00:28:41.210 --> 00:28:45.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon po, bibigyan tugon namin, bibigyan lunas din po namin

asr-000474
00:28:45.630 --> 00:28:51.930
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung mga yumakap po sa modernization na hindi po nakapagbayad ng amortization

asr-000475
