asr-000478
00:29:03.930 --> 00:29:06.450
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kaya may naiwan po yata ang 400 plus million.

asr-000479
00:29:06.910 --> 00:29:08.970
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yun po yung actual number po dyan.

asr-000480
00:29:09.370 --> 00:29:16.430
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ay i-download po namin sa LTFRB upang mabigyan natin ng amortization tulong po

asr-000481
00:29:16.430 --> 00:29:22.970
