asr-000482
00:29:22.970 --> 00:29:25.570
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So yan po, we can update that po.

asr-000483
00:29:25.850 --> 00:29:28.970
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nakipagtulungan po kami sa DBM po dun sa SARO.

asr-000484
00:29:29.730 --> 00:29:35.990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At meron lang kaming bibigay ng mga dokumento para po ay mailabas na po yung SARO po.

asr-000485
00:29:36.110 --> 00:29:43.050
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair, but just briefly, for example, yung 2022 na 1.6 billion na unobligated,

asr-000486
00:29:43.190 --> 00:29:47.490
