asr-000497
00:30:13.880 --> 00:30:16.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: PTMP, we have to move

asr-000498
00:30:16.060 --> 00:30:17.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: forward lang po, ginawa namin mas maayos

