00:30:28.160 --> 00:30:30.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I mean, for those who are

asr-000505
00:30:30.140 --> 00:30:32.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: already part of a PTMP

asr-000506
00:30:32.120 --> 00:30:33.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: during those years po.

