02:14:01.270 --> 02:14:03.330
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 2026, it was

asr-003742
02:14:03.330 --> 02:14:05.490
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 100, almost, a little

asr-003743
02:14:05.490 --> 02:14:07.210
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: above 123 billion.

asr-003744
02:14:08.170 --> 02:14:08.830
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ano na ba yung

asr-003745
02:14:08.830 --> 02:14:11.530
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: appropriated, obligated, at

asr-003746
02:14:11.530 --> 02:14:13.290
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: nagastos dito?

asr-003747
02:14:27.980 --> 02:14:29.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: With your permission, po, Mr. Chair,

asr-003748
02:14:29.660 --> 02:14:31.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I'll defer po to Usec TJ.

asr-003749
02:14:31.840 --> 02:14:33.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: You should have his number, po, pagdating

asr-003750
02:14:33.420 --> 02:14:34.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sa obligation and utilization.

asr-003751
02:14:36.260 --> 02:14:37.620
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Mr. Chair, for

asr-003752
02:14:37.620 --> 02:14:38.400
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: NSCR

asr-003753
02:14:38.400 --> 02:14:40.760
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: 2026, and

asr-003754
02:14:40.760 --> 02:14:43.300
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: 2026, continuing,

asr-003755
02:14:44.160 --> 02:14:45.140
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: 2025, continuing,

asr-003756
02:14:45.160 --> 02:14:47.500
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: total po is

asr-003757
02:14:47.500 --> 02:14:49.060
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: 67 billion.

asr-003758
02:14:49.700 --> 02:14:51.000
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: And then as of June

asr-003759
02:14:51.000 --> 02:14:53.180
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: 2026, obligation

asr-003760
02:14:53.180 --> 02:14:55.160
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: is at 89.89%,

asr-003761
02:14:56.780 --> 02:14:57.160
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: and

asr-003762
02:14:57.780 --> 02:14:58.920
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: disbursement is at

asr-003763
02:14:58.920 --> 02:15:00.950
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: 47.9%.

asr-003764
02:15:00.960 --> 02:15:08.380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And now in your estimation, to complete the project, sapat na ba yung alokasyon mo?

asr-003765
02:15:08.520 --> 02:15:11.280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ilan pa yung kukulangin? Ilan pa yung kakailanganin?

asr-003766
02:15:13.240 --> 02:15:16.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I'll defer to you, Sec. TJ, kasi yung budget proposal po namin,

asr-003767
02:15:17.000 --> 02:15:21.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay malaki po yung variance pagdating po sa NEP na binigay sa dalawang proyektong ito.

asr-003768
02:15:21.960 --> 02:15:33.140
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: So, Mr. Chair, kulang po. Ang original po na budget proposal ni NSCR for 2027 was P313 billion.

asr-003769
02:15:33.880 --> 02:15:37.340
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: And we were given po, as you have noted, P100.

asr-003770
02:15:38.960 --> 02:15:44.920
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: So, may additional funding requirements po that will still be rolled over to the following [unclear].

asr-003771
02:15:44.920 --> 02:15:49.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But dito sa P312 billion na kailangan nyo,

asr-003772
02:15:50.460 --> 02:15:51.920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: is it a portion of...

asr-003773
02:15:51.960 --> 02:15:58.100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: is also financed, sourced from foreign-funded loans?

asr-003774
02:15:58.800 --> 02:16:08.420
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Yes, Mr. Chair. Out of this P313 billion, P265 billion is coming from the NJICA loans.

asr-003775
02:16:08.420 --> 02:16:12.680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. Kung may P261 billion ka coming from loans,

asr-003776
02:16:12.800 --> 02:16:17.360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: and then P123 galing sa appropriations ng Congress,

asr-003777
02:16:17.840 --> 02:16:21.420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: bakit kukulangin ka pa rin if you only need P300 billion?

asr-003778
02:16:21.960 --> 02:16:22.300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Plus.

asr-003779
02:16:22.760 --> 02:16:28.440
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Mr. Chair, out of the P265 billion loan proceeds needed,

asr-003780
02:16:28.920 --> 02:16:31.600
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: only P97 billion in the NEP.

asr-003781
02:16:32.260 --> 02:16:36.720
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: And out of the P47 billion GOP counterpart needed,

asr-003782
02:16:37.200 --> 02:16:39.120
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: only P26 billion is in the NEP.

asr-003783
02:16:39.120 --> 02:16:49.360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. So, yun nga yung actually yung nagiging concern ko ulit.

asr-003784
02:16:49.480 --> 02:16:52.940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because we undertake projects which...

asr-003785
02:16:53.780 --> 02:16:55.920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: which are not fully funded.

asr-003786
02:16:56.540 --> 02:16:58.360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang problema, pagka nangutang ka,

asr-003787
02:16:59.060 --> 02:17:01.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: nagbabayad ka ng interest sa utang,

asr-003788
02:17:02.340 --> 02:17:05.640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: pero hindi umuusad yung proyekyo.

asr-003789
02:17:05.640 --> 02:17:16.100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We end up losing a bigger portion of the limited fiscal funds available to us.

asr-003790
02:17:17.540 --> 02:17:19.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, well, given these challenges,

asr-003791
02:17:20.820 --> 02:17:23.020
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung north to south, kailan po natin matatapos?

asr-003792
02:17:23.140 --> 02:17:23.740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang target?

asr-003793
02:17:23.780 --> 02:17:24.240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang target natin?

asr-003794
02:17:25.480 --> 02:17:28.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The N1 po, yung malolos hanggang Valenzuela,

asr-003795
02:17:28.640 --> 02:17:30.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the first phase po ay target natin.

asr-003796
02:17:30.900 --> 02:17:31.640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 2027?

asr-003797
02:17:31.920 --> 02:17:32.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: December.

asr-003798
02:17:33.040 --> 02:17:35.640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero this goes all the way to Clark, diba?

asr-003799
02:17:35.720 --> 02:17:36.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes po.

asr-003800
02:17:36.560 --> 02:17:39.080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung pagdating po natin hanggang sa Clark po,

asr-003801
02:17:39.100 --> 02:17:40.280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the entire Valenzuela,

asr-003802
02:17:41.340 --> 02:17:44.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang target po namin for the demonstration run po,

asr-003803
02:17:44.520 --> 02:17:45.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ibig sabihin hindi siya revenue operations,

asr-003804
02:17:46.740 --> 02:17:49.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung N2 po natin ay sana po matapos namin

asr-003805
02:17:49.960 --> 02:17:53.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung demonstration run by June of 2028 po.

asr-003806
02:17:53.780 --> 02:17:57.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tapos after that, doon na po kasi yung tamang testing and commissioning

asr-003807
02:17:57.500 --> 02:17:59.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at para sa revenue operations na po.

asr-003808
02:17:59.440 --> 02:18:02.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, for revenue operations, kailan ang ano natin? Estimated?

asr-003809
02:18:02.720 --> 02:18:08.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think our estimate is more or less last quarter of 2028.

asr-003810
02:18:08.180 --> 02:18:09.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Baka kakayanin na po.

asr-003811
02:18:09.160 --> 02:18:10.680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sino ba gumagawa nito?

asr-003812
02:18:11.280 --> 02:18:14.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It's composed of different packages po.

asr-003813
02:18:15.000 --> 02:18:16.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Contract packages.

asr-003814
02:18:16.380 --> 02:18:21.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And several contract packages have different contractors po.

asr-003815
02:18:22.320 --> 02:18:22.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Foreign contractors?

asr-003816
02:18:22.720 --> 02:18:25.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Foreign contractors, local or kasi ba?

asr-003817
02:18:25.620 --> 02:18:31.280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May foreign contractors, but may ka-JV po na mga local contractors.

asr-003818
02:18:31.480 --> 02:18:34.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If I can name some po, ka-JV din po nila ang DMCI,

asr-003819
02:18:35.600 --> 02:18:37.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think EEI.

asr-003820
02:18:38.000 --> 02:18:39.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: These are reputable companies.

asr-003821
02:18:39.440 --> 02:18:42.480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: These are the big reputable local counterparts,

asr-003822
02:18:42.720 --> 02:18:44.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: hindi yung kunsino-sino na lang.

asr-003823
02:18:44.220 --> 02:18:48.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po, reputable Filipino counterparts po na companies po.

asr-003824
02:18:48.640 --> 02:18:49.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, what about the subway?

asr-003825
02:18:49.800 --> 02:18:51.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The subway, ganun din po.

asr-003826
02:18:51.940 --> 02:18:52.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It's a JICA.

asr-003827
02:18:52.720 --> 02:18:58.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang target natin sa subway is, I think, 2031.

asr-003828
02:18:59.300 --> 02:19:02.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero ang kagandahan po dito, kung masasabi ko lang po,

asr-003829
02:19:02.700 --> 02:19:05.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: itong dito parte sa Mayquezon City,

asr-003830
02:19:05.560 --> 02:19:10.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung East Valenzuela hanggang dito sa Quirino Station,

asr-003831
02:19:10.940 --> 02:19:14.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung tunnel po niyan, both southbound and northbound,

asr-003832
02:19:14.920 --> 02:19:16.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: 100% na po.

asr-003833
02:19:16.460 --> 02:19:18.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: This is, I think, 1.5 kilometers.

asr-003834
02:19:18.720 --> 02:19:19.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Buong-buo na po.

asr-003835
02:19:19.540 --> 02:19:20.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Butas na po yan.

asr-003836
02:19:20.400 --> 02:19:22.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun din po yung ating North

asr-003837
02:19:22.720 --> 02:19:27.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Avenue hanggang Tandang Sora ho yata, 100% na rin po 'yan.

asr-003838
02:19:27.340 --> 02:19:27.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tuloy-tuloy.

asr-003839
02:19:28.120 --> 02:19:31.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Then yung ating Camp Aguinaldo, papuntang Anona sa Casio,

asr-003840
02:19:31.700 --> 02:19:34.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think around 90% na po yung tunnel natin dyan.

asr-003841
02:19:34.640 --> 02:19:39.080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So talagang yung butas, kung hindi man 100%,

asr-003842
02:19:39.080 --> 02:19:43.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: there's a significant progress po sa pagtatunnel natin sa mga ganitong subway po.

asr-003843
02:19:43.880 --> 02:19:46.260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And what is the target date of completion?

asr-003844
02:19:47.500 --> 02:19:48.060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Operation.

asr-003845
02:19:48.060 --> 02:19:50.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Operation is around 2031 po.

asr-003846
02:19:51.000 --> 02:19:51.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 2031.

asr-003847
02:19:52.720 --> 02:19:54.780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Lastly, dahil pinapahinto na ako,

asr-003848
02:19:54.880 --> 02:20:02.860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung concern lang dito sa ginagawa natin sa may line that runs through itong Commonwealth Avenue.

asr-003849
02:20:03.400 --> 02:20:15.240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Meron tayong, I think, there's a terminal that will be placed sa may papasok ng University Avenue,

asr-003850
02:20:15.340 --> 02:20:17.580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: papasok ng UP doon sa labas.

asr-003851
02:20:17.580 --> 02:20:22.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I think this is kung saan malapit, almost katapat ng University Mall,

asr-003852
02:20:22.720 --> 02:20:35.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: but yung initial plan was ang entrance and exit was nasa side lang ng UP

asr-003853
02:20:35.800 --> 02:20:39.560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at wala doon sa kabilang side ng Commonwealth.

asr-003854
02:20:39.800 --> 02:20:42.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That was the initial plans that I think that was presented.

asr-003855
02:20:42.960 --> 02:20:49.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: At ang concern was why couldn't it be on both sides?

asr-003856
02:20:49.400 --> 02:20:54.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos I think UP raised the concern kasi ang initial plans was yung,

asr-003857
02:20:54.520 --> 02:21:07.240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: elevated yung terminal at hindi underground kasi yung that line goes under the Quezon Memorial Circle

asr-003858
02:21:07.240 --> 02:21:15.880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: then pumupunta sa, yun nga, lalabas sa Commonwealth, bakit kailangan sa taas yung...

asr-003859
02:21:15.880 --> 02:21:23.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If I may answer po, we're referring to the MRT-7 po, University Station.

asr-003860
02:21:23.780 --> 02:21:26.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think a few months back.

asr-003861
02:21:26.440 --> 02:21:31.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We had a meeting with the UP also po, okay, with the President, Atty. Jimenez,

asr-003862
02:21:31.020 --> 02:21:34.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at nagpapasalamat kami at nagkasundo na po kami.

asr-003863
02:21:34.140 --> 02:21:38.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Una po, to address the situation, dalawa po, northbound and southbound.

asr-003864
02:21:38.760 --> 02:21:42.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Bali eh, hindi po, eastbound and westbound po.

asr-003865
02:21:42.040 --> 02:21:46.280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung isa po ay bababa sa tingin namin doon sa may techno hub

asr-003866
02:21:46.280 --> 02:21:49.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para we can cover as many commuters as possible.

asr-003867
02:21:49.360 --> 02:21:55.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung isa po, yung papuntang westbound, ay the eastbound, bababa naman doon yung sa University Mall.

asr-003869
02:21:56.280 --> 02:21:57.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung isa po yung napakasunduan namin.

asr-003870
02:21:58.060 --> 02:21:59.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And it's elevated po.

asr-003871
02:21:59.860 --> 02:22:03.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kung anong design na gusto po ng UP, ay susundan po namin.

asr-003872
02:22:04.420 --> 02:22:08.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Isang rason kung bakit po hindi kami pumayag na maging underground.

asr-003873
02:22:09.160 --> 02:22:11.080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang Commonwealth po, napaka-traffic.

asr-003874
02:22:11.900 --> 02:22:14.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Imagine nyo po yan kapag ginawa nating underground,

asr-003875
02:22:14.360 --> 02:22:17.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: and we're trying to hit the target po na 2027,

asr-003876
02:22:17.500 --> 02:22:19.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: paano po yung cut and cover natin dyan?

asr-003877
02:22:21.300 --> 02:22:25.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We're just saying na, paano po, we're going to stop traffic doon sa UP.

asr-003878
02:22:26.280 --> 02:22:27.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Because we want to do it underground.

asr-003879
02:22:28.100 --> 02:22:32.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So I think the most practical way of addressing this is to elevate it.

asr-003880
02:22:32.180 --> 02:22:34.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Since elevated naman po lahat, halos,

asr-003881
02:22:34.520 --> 02:22:39.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: and we'll make sure that the design as wanted by UP, we'll just adopt it.

asr-003882
02:22:39.160 --> 02:22:41.940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. So at least yun yung importante para sa akin,

asr-003883
02:22:42.040 --> 02:22:44.860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at napakasunduan nyo na ni Press Gigi,

asr-003884
02:22:44.920 --> 02:22:47.500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: because he also raised this concern sa akin,

asr-003885
02:22:48.120 --> 02:22:50.480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung kung saan ilalagay yung stasyon,

asr-003886
02:22:50.660 --> 02:22:53.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at he wanted to make sure that it goes out both sides.

asr-003887
02:22:54.700 --> 02:22:55.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Opo. Salamat po.

asr-003888
02:22:56.280 --> 02:22:57.260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. Maraming salamat.

asr-003889
02:23:00.040 --> 02:23:01.460
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you very much, Kong Bong Suntay.

asr-003890
02:23:02.880 --> 02:23:04.040
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Two minutes suspension.

asr-003891
02:30:56.780 --> 02:31:01.960
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Good afternoon. Next to interpolate is Congresswoman Anna York-Bondoc.

asr-003892
02:31:01.960 --> 02:31:10.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you very much, Mr. Chairs and members of the DOTR family.

asr-003893
02:31:10.700 --> 02:31:14.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Honorable Secretary, magandang hapon po sa inyong lahat.

asr-003894
02:31:15.020 --> 02:31:23.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I come from the 4th District of Pampanga at dun po ang San Simón Tulaok exit po

asr-003895
02:31:23.700 --> 02:31:27.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and the toll plaza ng atin pong NLEX.

asr-003896
02:31:29.220 --> 02:31:36.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Last week, actually up to this week, from Friday until Tuesday, and today lang po, slight improvement,

asr-003897
02:31:36.760 --> 02:31:45.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: the passengers and commuters on the NLEX northbound and southbound suffered 10 kilometers traffic

asr-003898
02:31:45.120 --> 02:31:47.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and 10 to 12 hours delay.

asr-003899
02:31:48.380 --> 02:31:52.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mr. Secretary, honorable members, Mr. Chairman,

asr-003900
02:31:52.300 --> 02:31:54.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: grabe po ang nangyari sa mga tao.

asr-003901
02:31:55.980 --> 02:32:00.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: People were stuck in their cars for 10 to 12 hours, unable to eat.

asr-003902
02:32:00.800 --> 02:32:08.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Marami pong nag-CR na lang po along the highway, male and female, I am sorry to let you know, including seniors.

asr-003903
02:32:08.740 --> 02:32:15.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And there were a number of very sick people po, yung mga nangangailangan po talaga, who suffered so much.

asr-003904
02:32:16.200 --> 02:32:20.260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: As the Chairman of the TRB, could you comment on this and what are your plans?

asr-003905
02:32:20.260 --> 02:32:32.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Salamat po, Mr. Chairman, tama po, we commiserate with all the motorists who were stranded during ito po, pagbabaha sa San Simón po natin.

asr-003906
02:32:32.260 --> 02:32:44.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nung nalaman po natin itong pangyayari, hinatasan po natin ng TRB na magbigay ng notice to explain kaagad sa NLEX, para alamin kung ano talaga nangyari.

asr-003907
02:32:44.780 --> 02:32:48.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Other than that, there's another memo

asr-003908
02:32:48.760 --> 02:32:49.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: that was issued also by the TRB.

asr-003909
02:32:49.760 --> 02:33:01.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And this is more of, sabihin natin, to study the possibility, to reimburse, kahit pa paano yung manay-stranded sa traffic, kahit pa mas lalo na yung nag-turn back.

asr-003910
02:33:02.380 --> 02:33:05.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon po, may dalawa pong bagay that we have to address.

asr-003911
02:33:05.600 --> 02:33:08.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung una is the infrastructure itself.

asr-003912
02:33:09.220 --> 02:33:11.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung anong pong magagawa ng TRB?

asr-003913
02:33:11.920 --> 02:33:15.080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang TRB po kasi is composed of different agencies po.

asr-003914
02:33:15.080 --> 02:33:19.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang nangunguna po dyan is the DOTR, kami po eh for the toll setting.

asr-003915
02:33:19.760 --> 02:33:24.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At DPWH po, para tamang infrastructure po doon.

asr-003916
02:33:24.300 --> 02:33:30.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaapon po, nagpulong na po si Secretary Vince, kasama po ang TRB, kasama din po ang NLEX doon.

asr-003917
02:33:30.920 --> 02:33:36.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At mayroong mga plano na po na gagawin, short-term, mid-term, and long-term po.

asr-003918
02:33:37.040 --> 02:33:44.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At I was not able to attend the meeting po, andun po si Executive Director JR Tugade.

asr-003919
02:33:44.760 --> 02:33:49.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If I may just say po, in a nutshell, yung mga napag-usapan.

asr-003920
02:33:49.760 --> 02:33:54.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Could you share with us the short, medium, and long-term plans po na pinag-usapan?

asr-003921
02:33:55.990 --> 02:33:58.510
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And how soon po can we execute these?

asr-003922
02:33:59.810 --> 02:34:06.290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po yung napag-usapan din po, at ito yung mga plano po ng DPWH kasama po ang TRB.

asr-003923
02:34:06.890 --> 02:34:15.250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang una po yung pagtataas ng Tulaok Pavement by 0.6 meters northbound and 0.5 meters southbound.

asr-003924
02:34:15.250 --> 02:34:16.470
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito yung mga short-term nila.

asr-003925
02:34:17.170 --> 02:34:20.190
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: NLEX Design and Construct Perimeter Floodwall.

asr-003926
02:34:21.010 --> 02:34:23.890
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: DPWH po to dredge Tulaok.

asr-003927
02:34:24.630 --> 02:34:28.010
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dredge both trench parallel to NLEX, dito po yung sa gilid.

asr-003928
02:34:28.690 --> 02:34:34.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Install floodgate and sheet pile to prevent backflow from Tulaok River, both sides of NLEX.

asr-003929
02:34:34.710 --> 02:34:39.750
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Deploy heavy-duty siphoning pumps at the trenches to manage the collected water.

asr-003930
02:34:39.750 --> 02:34:47.570
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ito po yung mga sinabmit sa akin ni ED Tugade na maplaplanuhin po ng DPWH kasama po yung NLEX.

asr-003931
02:34:48.050 --> 02:34:50.750
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang long-term po nila is to repair collapses.

asr-003932
02:34:51.010 --> 02:34:56.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Portion of dike along San Jose at saka dito po sa San Simon.

asr-003933
02:34:56.810 --> 02:35:00.990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Construction of retarding basin po, impounding detention ponds.

asr-003934
02:35:01.510 --> 02:35:02.210
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Naku po ito.

asr-003935
02:35:03.170 --> 02:35:03.530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po.

asr-003936
02:35:04.070 --> 02:35:11.530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And meron din pong construction of floodway po, from Arayat to Manila.

asr-003937
02:35:11.530 --> 02:35:16.670
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ito po yung overall na plano ng DPWH as part of TRB po.

asr-003938
02:35:17.030 --> 02:35:19.850
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sa panig naman po ng DOTR.

asr-003939
02:35:20.170 --> 02:35:20.530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po yung...

asr-003940
02:35:21.010 --> 02:35:23.330
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang concern namin is more of the motorists.

asr-003941
02:35:23.790 --> 02:35:31.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ang inutus po natin sa NLEX, sa mga ganitong pangyayari, inutusan natin ng NLEX na mag-short message na po.

asr-003942
02:35:31.630 --> 02:35:33.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I-text na po lahat ang mga motorista.

asr-003943
02:35:34.510 --> 02:35:35.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mas lalo na po yung may RFID.

asr-003944
02:35:36.750 --> 02:35:38.210
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi meron naman silang numero.

asr-003945
02:35:38.650 --> 02:35:40.650
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So we just have to be proactive.

asr-003946
02:35:41.250 --> 02:35:44.750
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi po natin sinasabi na kasalanan ng NLEX yung pagbabaha.

asr-003947
02:35:45.390 --> 02:35:49.390
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yesterday po we appealed to them na magbigay kayo ng toll-free.

asr-003948
02:35:50.350 --> 02:35:50.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And it will be...

asr-003949
02:35:51.010 --> 02:35:53.330
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Part of your corporate social responsibility.

asr-003950
02:35:53.530 --> 02:35:54.910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At pumayag naman po sila.

asr-003951
02:35:55.230 --> 02:36:01.030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Moving forward, we expect them na they can basically naman malalaman kung bahana yung mga area na yun.

asr-003952
02:36:01.030 --> 02:36:06.030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And they just have to be proactive in informing our motorists na...

asr-003953
02:36:06.930 --> 02:36:11.090
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Actually po, yung nakalagay sa sulat, mga three hours before sana, sabihan na.

asr-003954
02:36:11.450 --> 02:36:13.830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Na certain areas hindi po madadaanan.

asr-003955
02:36:14.650 --> 02:36:16.250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So hopefully gagawin ng NLEX.

asr-003956
02:36:16.430 --> 02:36:20.030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sinabi naman po nila na sila'y tutupad dito sa...

asr-003957
02:36:21.010 --> 02:36:23.530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: They committed to comply with this directive.

asr-003958
02:36:24.030 --> 02:36:31.050
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi ngayon po merong mga sinasabi ng variable bit-bulitin yata na messaging dun sa NLEX.

asr-003959
02:36:31.050 --> 02:36:32.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero hindi po nakikita kasi.

asr-003960
02:36:33.290 --> 02:36:36.250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So may mga iba't-ibang pamamaraan sila.

asr-003961
02:36:36.370 --> 02:36:38.310
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May advisory sila sa social media.

asr-003962
02:36:38.950 --> 02:36:40.290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi naman sila nagkulang.

asr-003963
02:36:40.810 --> 02:36:44.890
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero sa tingin namin, hindi nakakarating sa ating mga motorista.

asr-003964
02:36:45.730 --> 02:36:48.830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ganun din po, nakikiusap na rin po kami sa aming motorista.

asr-003965
02:36:49.390 --> 02:36:50.850
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi alam na nila po.

asr-003966
02:36:50.850 --> 02:36:54.930
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At hindi po na traffic na po at hindi nadadaanan ang ating NLEX ngayon.

asr-003967
02:36:55.450 --> 02:37:02.870
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero po ang nangyayari, meron pang mga ibang motorista pa rin po na talagang gusto nila yung expressway na gamitin po.

asr-003968
02:37:03.190 --> 02:37:13.290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At na naiintindihan namin kasi siguro yung mga ibang alternative routes natin ay baha po pagdating sa Pampanga at dito po sa pagtaas po ng Webaysia po.

asr-003969
02:37:16.260 --> 02:37:18.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you for sharing that.

asr-003970
02:37:18.680 --> 02:37:21.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Are you aware na tinaas na po yung NLEX previously?

asr-003971
02:37:23.060 --> 02:37:24.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po, tinaas po yan.

asr-003972
02:37:26.240 --> 02:37:31.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon po, ang immediate nila is 0.6, itataas pa rin po I think, pati yung Tulao.

asr-003973
02:37:32.080 --> 02:37:35.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po, hindi dapat magtapos sa pagtataas lang ng kalsada.

asr-003974
02:37:36.040 --> 02:37:40.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi nakita na po natin to, ilang kalsada na po ang tinaas, ang nangyayari, lumit yung bahay.

asr-003975
02:37:41.460 --> 02:37:42.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ganun pa rin ang baha.

asr-003976
02:37:43.440 --> 02:37:50.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So at least for the NLEX way po, kapag ito'y makakatulong, wala naman po problema sa amin sa DOTR.

asr-003977
02:37:50.040 --> 02:37:51.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But it should not stop there.

asr-003978
02:37:52.500 --> 02:37:53.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The floodplains.

asr-003979
02:37:53.060 --> 02:37:58.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The flood mitigation and flood measure, should that stop in just elevating the road po?

asr-003980
02:37:58.440 --> 02:38:03.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi hindi po yun ang talagang magiging solusyon para po matigil ang pagbabaha.

asr-003981
02:38:04.960 --> 02:38:09.740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much and we agree with you, yung pagtataas po, hindi lang po yun yung solusyon.

asr-003982
02:38:10.200 --> 02:38:11.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: It has to be a holistic program.

asr-003983
02:38:12.500 --> 02:38:22.780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Last week, ganda ng timing, I brought this up po with, this has been brought up to me by the Climate Change Commission.

asr-003984
02:38:23.060 --> 02:38:33.780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they mentioned po sa akin, being the district concerned po, no, that the flooding along the NLEX is, as you know, MacArthur is completely flooded.

asr-003985
02:38:34.000 --> 02:38:36.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: That is the alternative road to the NLEX ngayon po.

asr-003986
02:38:36.740 --> 02:38:38.860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ngayon, umabot na sa NLEX yung problema.

asr-003987
02:38:39.380 --> 02:38:44.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I brought this up with Secretary Gibo Teodoro, mentioning it as a matter of national security.

asr-003988
02:38:45.240 --> 02:38:48.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At hindi lang po national security, that includes food security.

asr-003989
02:38:48.540 --> 02:38:53.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi kung ilang araw po na hindi po makadaan talaga sa NLEX, magkakaroon po tayo.

asr-003990
02:38:53.060 --> 02:38:58.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ang binanggit po niya was building an alternative expressway.

asr-003991
02:38:58.700 --> 02:39:01.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Can you shed your thoughts on this po?

asr-003992
02:39:02.000 --> 02:39:05.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po, yung ginagawa natin, the volume of water is just too much.

asr-003993
02:39:06.240 --> 02:39:08.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And the NLEX is really in a threatened position.

asr-003994
02:39:11.060 --> 02:39:12.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So basically, he wanted to build a new NLEX.

asr-003995
02:39:13.060 --> 02:39:16.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kung siya daw ang tatanungin, he wanted to build a new NLEX.

asr-003996
02:39:17.940 --> 02:39:21.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I have to confer with Secretary Guibot.

asr-003997
02:39:21.100 --> 02:39:23.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Alam ko na may pinanggagalingan siya.

asr-003998
02:39:23.120 --> 02:39:24.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Maganda yung konsepto.

asr-003999
02:39:24.160 --> 02:39:28.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But may mga questions on top of my mind right now, Mr. Chairman.

asr-004000
02:39:28.480 --> 02:39:29.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Is this elevated?

asr-004001
02:39:30.720 --> 02:39:32.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Parang more of a viaduct po talaga.

asr-004002
02:39:33.400 --> 02:39:36.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi that area probably needs a viaduct na rin po.

asr-004003
02:39:36.600 --> 02:39:42.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If that would resolve the issue of flood po, dun sa area na po, kami po isusuportahan po namin.

asr-004004
02:39:44.060 --> 02:39:48.160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sir, I just wanted to bring up also, I know this is not the Department of Public Works and Highways.

asr-004005
02:39:49.780 --> 02:39:50.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Nakaredi na po yung slide.

asr-004006
02:39:50.980 --> 02:39:51.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We have five...

asr-004007
02:39:51.980 --> 02:39:56.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The NLEX and the Kandababayda crosses the Pampanga River.

asr-004008
02:39:57.460 --> 02:40:02.440
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: That is yung pinaka separating the north and the southern portions of Luzon.

asr-004009
02:40:02.960 --> 02:40:05.380
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So yung blue po, yun po yung Pampanga River.

asr-004010
02:40:05.880 --> 02:40:08.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The red is the NLEX and the green line is the MacArthur.

asr-004011
02:40:08.980 --> 02:40:10.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At the moment, wala na po si MacArthur.

asr-004012
02:40:11.320 --> 02:40:13.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Si NLEX is threatened.

asr-004013
02:40:13.720 --> 02:40:19.660
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So we have five bridges po across the Pampanga River, which the DPWH has not completed.

asr-004014
02:40:19.660 --> 02:40:21.740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So nakatiwangwang lang po.

asr-004015
02:40:21.980 --> 02:40:25.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ayan po yung mga tulayo, which can solve some of the problems.

asr-004016
02:40:25.480 --> 02:40:32.740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Lima po sila, ayan po, may pilote lang po, pero hindi po tinatapos ng DPWH.

asr-004017
02:40:32.740 --> 02:40:38.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We could have passed through all of these bridges po, and reduced the problems po on the NLEX.

asr-004018
02:40:38.080 --> 02:40:44.620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So sana po, just to make you aware, we have a bridge exactly right next to the NLEX po, na viaduct din po.

asr-004019
02:40:44.620 --> 02:40:46.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So sana po matapos din, and sana...

asr-004020
02:40:46.960 --> 02:40:51.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We would realize that the NLEX is, I used to say, threatened.

asr-004021
02:40:51.540 --> 02:40:51.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ngayon po.

asr-004022
02:40:51.940 --> 02:40:53.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: It has really come true na po.

asr-004023
02:40:53.940 --> 02:40:55.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Na problema po yan.

asr-004024
02:40:55.940 --> 02:41:00.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I'd also like to mention po, ayan, yung mga tulay po na hindi tinatapos po.

asr-004025
02:41:00.940 --> 02:41:02.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: All of that is expanding the Pampanga River.

asr-004026
02:41:02.940 --> 02:41:06.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And yan po ang ating alternative routes po sa NLEX.

asr-004027
02:41:06.940 --> 02:41:11.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi yung mga local roads, pwede pong daanan yung iba eh.

asr-004028
02:41:11.940 --> 02:41:13.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Including that there is a dike.

asr-004029
02:41:13.940 --> 02:41:15.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kaya lang po, we need a bridge.

asr-004030
02:41:15.940 --> 02:41:16.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So ayan po yung mga tulay.

asr-004031
02:41:16.940 --> 02:41:19.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So just to let you know po that there are alternative roads

asr-004032
02:41:19.940 --> 02:41:20.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: that the DPWH

asr-004033
02:41:20.940 --> 02:41:21.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: is not constructing,

asr-004034
02:41:21.940 --> 02:41:22.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and alternative

asr-004035
02:41:22.940 --> 02:41:24.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: bridges po.

asr-004036
02:41:24.940 --> 02:41:26.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So thank you po.

asr-004037
02:41:26.940 --> 02:41:28.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Would you like to comment po?

asr-004038
02:41:28.940 --> 02:41:32.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Siguro we need to find bypass roads and alternative bridges ano po?

asr-004039
02:41:32.940 --> 02:41:34.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We relate to Secretary Dizon, Mr. Chair.

asr-004040
02:41:34.940 --> 02:41:36.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At salamat po for informing us also.

asr-004041
02:41:36.940 --> 02:41:37.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you po.

asr-004042
02:41:37.940 --> 02:41:38.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much for that.

asr-004043
02:41:38.940 --> 02:41:39.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Question…

asr-004044
02:41:39.940 --> 02:41:41.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Another question po.

asr-004045
02:41:41.940 --> 02:41:44.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: One of the issues po has been the Bulacan Airport.

asr-004046
02:41:44.940 --> 02:41:50.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Of which, Sir RSA had a press conference yesterday, I believe, or this morning.

asr-004047
02:41:50.940 --> 02:41:51.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But it hasn't come out yet.

asr-004048
02:41:51.940 --> 02:41:59.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes. We have inquired from the DPWH about this and they have always referred us to the DOTR. Can you give us your thoughts?

asr-004049
02:42:01.540 --> 02:42:16.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po. Ang proyekto po ng New Manila International Airport ay being implemented po ng DOTr. It's a PPP project. Nagsimula po 'yan, it's an unsolicited project. At ngayon po ay mino-monitor namin 'yan.

asr-004050
02:42:16.680 --> 02:42:18.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang pagkakaalam ko po dito...

asr-004050-split-2
02:42:18.700 --> 02:42:22.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sorry po, solicited?

asr-004050-split-3
02:42:22.000 --> 02:42:24.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: This is an unsolicited project.

asr-004050-split-4
02:42:24.000 --> 02:42:26.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Can you explain po what you mean by unsolicited?

asr-004051
02:42:28.840 --> 02:42:30.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ito pong airport, ideya po ba ito ng gobyerno?

asr-004052
02:42:30.700 --> 02:42:44.720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pag sinasabi po kasi natin unsolicited project, dalawa po 'yan. May nakalagay sa batas natin. Either merong new technology or this is not part of the, sabihin nating, priority infrastructure po ng gobyerno natin.

asr-004053
02:42:46.680 --> 02:42:52.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Saan po ito nakakahulog sa unsolicited?

asr-004054
02:42:52.100 --> 02:42:58.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It could be, hindi siya kasama sa mga priority project at that time.

asr-004055
02:42:58.840 --> 02:43:06.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: This was a past administration po. Hindi siya nasama sa mga priority project of the government at that time.

asr-004056
02:43:06.740 --> 02:43:14.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At bago po kasi 'yan, ito po'y dumadaan sa maraming sangay ng gobyerno at that time, NEDA and everything.

asr-004057
02:43:14.820 --> 02:43:16.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sinasabi po natin ngayon is...

asr-004058
02:43:16.680 --> 02:43:33.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang alam po namin, ato naman ay the legal process, before a construction should begin or the implementation of a project, may mga kailangan pong dokumento, requisitos, mga sa galing sa mga iba't ibang kagawaran.

asr-004059
02:43:33.320 --> 02:43:39.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And one good example is the ECC, or the New Manila International Airport.

asr-004060
02:43:39.760 --> 02:43:45.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At hindi po makakapagsimula ang isang airport na ganito kung hindi naman po ito'y dumaan sa ating DNR.

asr-004061
02:43:45.680 --> 02:44:01.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Narinig ko rin po yung mga sabi-sabi na ang sanhi ng pagbabaha dito ngayon is because of the New Manila International Airport.

asr-004062
02:44:01.500 --> 02:44:12.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Personally po ako, we have to be very circumspect po in the sense na hindi po natin dapat magsabi ng isa na rason lamang.

asr-004063
02:44:13.780 --> 02:44:15.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ako po hindi ko po masasabi.

asr-004064
02:44:15.680 --> 02:44:20.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sanhi ng pagbabaha is New Manila International Airport.

asr-004065
02:44:20.340 --> 02:44:33.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi kapag titignan ko po, yung kanina po, yung mapa nakita ko nga po, yung lokasyon po ng Bulacan Airport, yung New Manila International Airport, is southeast po eh.

asr-004066
02:44:33.620 --> 02:44:36.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pagdating po sa kung saan yung Pampanga River.

asr-004067
02:44:36.620 --> 02:44:39.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung po yun po ang point of reference po natin.

asr-004068
02:44:39.540 --> 02:44:40.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Medyo andito po.

asr-004069
02:44:41.020 --> 02:44:45.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, as sa tingin ko po, kapag sinabi natin ng...

asr-004070
02:44:45.680 --> 02:44:53.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Rason talaga ay New Manila International Airport, ang sinasabi ko po, kailangang aralin talaga.

asr-004071
02:44:54.120 --> 02:44:59.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung ito ba ay talagang naging sanhi ng pagbabaha sa endless.

asr-004072
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:02.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at sa dito po sa Pampanga.

asr-004073
02:45:02.940 --> 02:45:04.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero ang pagkakalam ko po dito,

asr-004074
02:45:05.380 --> 02:45:07.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: matagal na pong may master plan supposedly

asr-004075
02:45:07.780 --> 02:45:09.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: for the last so many years,

asr-004076
02:45:10.140 --> 02:45:11.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: hindi lang po na-implement

asr-004077
02:45:11.520 --> 02:45:14.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: dito sa entire Pampanga,

asr-004078
02:45:14.440 --> 02:45:15.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the entire flood mitigation,

asr-004079
02:45:16.680 --> 02:45:18.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: hindi lang po yata na-implement po.

asr-004080
02:45:22.020 --> 02:45:23.820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much po for your thoughts

asr-004081
02:45:23.820 --> 02:45:25.440
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: on the Bulacan Airport.

asr-004082
02:45:26.380 --> 02:45:27.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So last question po,

asr-004083
02:45:29.160 --> 02:45:30.560
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: yung Baja po sa amin

asr-004084
02:45:30.560 --> 02:45:32.820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: is persisting for six weeks,

asr-004085
02:45:33.380 --> 02:45:35.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: for months actually.

asr-004086
02:45:36.200 --> 02:45:38.380
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Paano po yung public transport doon?

asr-004087
02:45:38.860 --> 02:45:39.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi hindi naman po pwedeng

asr-004088
02:45:39.900 --> 02:45:41.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: libring sakay na lang po forever.

asr-004089
02:45:42.400 --> 02:45:45.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At bumigay na po yung 6x6 truck po ng Army.

asr-004090
02:45:45.740 --> 02:45:46.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Nagpapatsalamat nga po ako

asr-004091
02:45:46.700 --> 02:45:48.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: sa Philippine Army last week.

asr-004092
02:45:48.480 --> 02:45:49.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Baka next week,

asr-004093
02:45:49.100 --> 02:45:51.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Philippine Navy na po ang pinasasalamatan ko.

asr-004094
02:45:51.880 --> 02:45:53.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I personally had to leave my house by boat.

asr-004095
02:45:54.360 --> 02:45:55.360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So what is our,

asr-004096
02:45:55.980 --> 02:45:58.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: parang yearly na po ito, ano po?

asr-004097
02:45:58.280 --> 02:46:02.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: What are our public transport options po

asr-004098
02:46:02.840 --> 02:46:04.740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: for commuters in flooded areas?

asr-004099
02:46:06.260 --> 02:46:07.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It's a very good question po,

asr-004100
02:46:07.620 --> 02:46:08.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chairman.

asr-004101
02:46:08.800 --> 02:46:09.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang alam ko po,

asr-004102
02:46:09.980 --> 02:46:10.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pagdating po,

asr-004103
02:46:10.800 --> 02:46:11.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think we're referring

asr-004104
02:46:11.760 --> 02:46:13.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: doon sa mga lugar po sa loob,

asr-004105
02:46:14.040 --> 02:46:15.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung mga munisipyo.

asr-004106
02:46:15.380 --> 02:46:17.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: MacArthur Highway is a major road.

asr-004107
02:46:17.900 --> 02:46:18.820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And to get from,

asr-004108
02:46:18.820 --> 02:46:23.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: from Apalit to San Fernando,

asr-004109
02:46:23.640 --> 02:46:24.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: you cannot travel.

asr-004110
02:46:25.340 --> 02:46:27.140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Opo, sa harap po ng SM Marilao,

asr-004111
02:46:27.140 --> 02:46:28.020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: ang taas po ng,

asr-004112
02:46:28.020 --> 02:46:30.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: ang binaha po yung

asr-004113
02:46:30.800 --> 02:46:32.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Vista Mall Malolos

asr-004114
02:46:32.400 --> 02:46:33.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: along MacArthur Highway.

asr-004115
02:46:34.300 --> 02:46:37.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So that is a major commuter highway po

asr-004116
02:46:37.280 --> 02:46:39.860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: with numerous buses

asr-004117
02:46:39.860 --> 02:46:41.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and jeep po.

asr-004118
02:46:41.920 --> 02:46:42.880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So paano po yun?

asr-004119
02:46:43.660 --> 02:46:45.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po, nagtatagal na.

asr-004120
02:46:45.080 --> 02:46:47.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: It's not only like one week,

asr-004121
02:46:47.400 --> 02:46:49.260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: but it's already lasting months.

asr-004122
02:46:49.580 --> 02:46:51.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So ano po yung public transport options

asr-004123
02:46:51.460 --> 02:46:53.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: na pinag-uusapan po ninyo?

asr-004124
02:46:53.740 --> 02:46:55.000
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Kong Ana, please wrap up your question.

asr-004125
02:46:55.000 --> 02:46:55.720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: As to the PAP,

asr-004126
02:46:55.720 --> 02:46:57.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ngayon po, ang alam ko lang po dyan

asr-004127
02:46:57.380 --> 02:46:58.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: is by land eh.

asr-004128
02:46:58.660 --> 02:46:59.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mga bus,

asr-004129
02:47:00.300 --> 02:47:02.200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: wala na ba tayong ibang infra

asr-004130
02:47:02.200 --> 02:47:05.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: dito pagdating sa transportation system natin.

asr-004131
02:47:05.320 --> 02:47:06.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Wala hong relays dyan.

asr-004132
02:47:07.980 --> 02:47:09.880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The reason I'm asking for this is

asr-004133
02:47:09.880 --> 02:47:11.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: paulit-ulit na po yung problema.

asr-004134
02:47:11.940 --> 02:47:14.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We're gonna rely on the Army 6x6 truck,

asr-004135
02:47:14.540 --> 02:47:15.560
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: libring sakay.

asr-004136
02:47:16.220 --> 02:47:18.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: There are thousands of people working,

asr-004137
02:47:18.380 --> 02:47:19.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: living and working po.

asr-004138
02:47:19.880 --> 02:47:22.360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: These are four towns sa Pampanga

asr-004139
02:47:22.360 --> 02:47:24.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and I'm sure meron pang kalumpit,

asr-004140
02:47:24.360 --> 02:47:26.880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Hagonoy, Malolos, Paumbok.

asr-004141
02:47:26.880 --> 02:47:28.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Paano po sila magtatrabaho?

asr-004142
02:47:30.890 --> 02:47:31.890
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: May plano na po ba?

asr-004143
02:47:31.970 --> 02:47:33.590
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At pinag-uusapan na po ba ito?

asr-004144
02:47:33.750 --> 02:47:37.490
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang ngayon po kasi sa aming feasibility study,

asr-004145
02:47:37.890 --> 02:47:39.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang pinag-aaralan po namin ngayon

asr-004146
02:47:39.630 --> 02:47:41.190
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: is yung talagang mga major.

asr-004147
02:47:42.930 --> 02:47:43.850
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Opo, opo.

asr-004148
02:47:43.930 --> 02:47:46.170
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And we're starting parang sa railway po natin.

asr-004149
02:47:46.510 --> 02:47:48.510
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Palabas na po kami sa Metro Manila.

asr-004150
02:47:49.010 --> 02:47:50.770
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po meron na tayong Pampanga

asr-004151
02:47:50.770 --> 02:47:52.790
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sa North-South Commuter Railway.

asr-004152
02:47:53.390 --> 02:47:55.250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Magsisimula din kami sa Mindanao Rail.

asr-004153
02:47:55.590 --> 02:47:57.670
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At thank you for raising that question.

asr-004154
02:47:57.670 --> 02:47:58.170
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Maybe I can ask you a question.

asr-004155
02:47:58.190 --> 02:48:03.910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, maybe I can ask our office sa planning po

asr-004156
02:48:03.910 --> 02:48:06.190
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: to start also conducting feasibility study

asr-004157
02:48:06.750 --> 02:48:09.710
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pagating dito sa mga sinasabi nating mamababang lugar

asr-004158
02:48:09.710 --> 02:48:11.190
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kung sa parating merong baha.

asr-004159
02:48:12.050 --> 02:48:14.410
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Upang sa ganon, if there's a need for infra,

asr-004160
02:48:14.750 --> 02:48:15.610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: mga rail din po,

asr-004161
02:48:15.690 --> 02:48:17.470
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay mailalagay natin sa tamang panahon

asr-004162
02:48:17.470 --> 02:48:19.310
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at kapag mapunduhan po natin.

asr-004163
02:48:22.620 --> 02:48:27.020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And lastly, yung railway from Calamba to Clark.

asr-004164
02:48:27.680 --> 02:48:29.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Just to let you know na yung railway po,

asr-004165
02:48:30.780 --> 02:48:31.760
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: there was a map eh.

asr-004166
02:48:32.220 --> 02:48:34.260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So it's the NLEX and then MacArthur

asr-004167
02:48:34.260 --> 02:48:35.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and then the railway.

asr-004168
02:48:35.660 --> 02:48:38.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So yung railway is even further into the flooded area.

asr-004169
02:48:38.740 --> 02:48:39.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ano pong plano nyo?

asr-004170
02:48:39.820 --> 02:48:43.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: How will we get to the railway kung sakali bang matapos at any point?

asr-004171
02:48:45.220 --> 02:48:47.720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Lahat naman po kapag nagtayo tayo ng relays,

asr-004172
02:48:47.820 --> 02:48:50.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: dapat po meron parating connectivity papunta sa relays.

asr-004173
02:48:51.940 --> 02:48:54.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po, at yan po yung isa sa amin titignan.

asr-004174
02:48:55.100 --> 02:48:59.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ang importante po sa amin ngayon is how to address.

asr-004175
02:48:59.240 --> 02:49:00.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: That's why the flood.

asr-004176
02:49:00.780 --> 02:49:04.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The flood itself, that's why po nangyayipagtulungan kami sa DPWH.

asr-004177
02:49:04.820 --> 02:49:06.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Meron tayong mga ginagawa.

asr-004178
02:49:06.480 --> 02:49:08.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It's a long-term solution po.

asr-004179
02:49:08.560 --> 02:49:11.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero at least sa kagawaran ng transportasyon,

asr-004180
02:49:11.500 --> 02:49:15.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung tinatayo naming malalaking public transport system,

asr-004181
02:49:15.560 --> 02:49:18.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ayun po ay hindi mababaha kasi elevated.

asr-004182
02:49:18.480 --> 02:49:20.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang problema na lang natin, tama po kayo,

asr-004183
02:49:20.900 --> 02:49:22.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung access papunta doon.

asr-004184
02:49:22.880 --> 02:49:26.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And that is something na kailangan ng whole of government approach.

asr-004185
02:49:26.380 --> 02:49:30.660
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We need the competence and the advice.

asr-004186
02:49:30.780 --> 02:49:34.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Also of DPWH and a cross-coordination po with them.

asr-004187
02:49:35.220 --> 02:49:37.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I just wanted to bring this up kasi po,

asr-004188
02:49:38.420 --> 02:49:41.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: binanggit ko na po yun and they said that they need to put it there

asr-004189
02:49:41.060 --> 02:49:42.520
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: because that is the right of way.

asr-004190
02:49:43.120 --> 02:49:46.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pero yung right of way na yun is now completely underwater.

asr-004191
02:49:46.920 --> 02:49:48.640
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I just wanted to let you know po.

asr-004192
02:49:49.060 --> 02:49:51.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: From, ano po, from I think there's a Malolo station

asr-004193
02:49:51.700 --> 02:49:55.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and then hanggang San Fernando, completely flooded po yun.

asr-004194
02:49:56.680 --> 02:49:59.920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, yun po, para for your information lang po

asr-004195
02:49:59.920 --> 02:50:02.920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: at para makapagplano po kayo po ano pong gusto nyong gawin.

asr-004196
02:50:03.400 --> 02:50:05.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you po, Mr. Sherry, for informing us.

asr-004197
02:50:05.940 --> 02:50:08.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And lastly, I would like to thank the Coast Guard.

asr-004198
02:50:08.640 --> 02:50:09.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Parang wala ata sila, no?

asr-004199
02:50:10.700 --> 02:50:11.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ayan, oo po.

asr-004200
02:50:11.680 --> 02:50:14.320
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I would again like to thank and commend the Coast Guard.

asr-004201
02:50:14.780 --> 02:50:17.600
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi kami po ay hindi lang po nagsasuffer ng baha.

asr-004202
02:50:17.900 --> 02:50:19.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But we planned before the baha.

asr-004203
02:50:20.000 --> 02:50:23.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, nagkaroon po kami ng third year, year three na po ito.

asr-004204
02:50:23.660 --> 02:50:26.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Largest coastal cleanup of Manila Bay.

asr-004205
02:50:26.080 --> 02:50:29.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ayan po ang Philippine Army, Philippine Navy, Philippine Coast Guard.

asr-004206
02:50:29.920 --> 02:50:31.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004207
02:50:32.300 --> 02:50:36.160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: LGU po and the DNR, Estero Rangers.

asr-004208
02:50:36.740 --> 02:50:42.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, this June, they cleared out po 15,000 sako po ng basura.

asr-004209
02:50:43.400 --> 02:50:46.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, yung sa amin po, kahit may baha, wala namang basura.

asr-004210
02:50:46.620 --> 02:50:49.140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, I would personally like to commend the Coast Guard

asr-004211
02:50:49.140 --> 02:50:51.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: sa pakikipagtulungan po nila sa amin.

asr-004212
02:50:52.000 --> 02:50:55.920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they have conducted numerous rescues po during this disaster.

asr-004213
02:50:56.400 --> 02:50:59.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sana po, bigyan niyo po sila ng maraming maraming gamit.

asr-004214
02:51:00.160 --> 02:51:01.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi kailangan po namin.

asr-004215
02:51:01.920 --> 02:51:04.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ako pa po ang nagbigay ng kanilang speedboat.

asr-004216
02:51:04.840 --> 02:51:07.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Otherwise, wala po silang gamit.

asr-004217
02:51:07.980 --> 02:51:12.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, I would like to request for full support po sa mga pangangailangan ng Coast Guard

asr-004218
02:51:12.240 --> 02:51:18.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: during this disaster and to personally commend them po sa kanila pong tulong sa distrito namin.

asr-004219
02:51:18.900 --> 02:51:20.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, maraming salamat po, Coast Guard.

asr-004220
02:51:20.960 --> 02:51:24.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Again, full support po kami, Sec Lopez, sa inyo pong budget.

asr-004221
02:51:24.100 --> 02:51:26.260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And to the DOTR family,

asr-004222
02:51:26.260 --> 02:51:31.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: sana po, we'll recognize that during this period of extreme climate change po,

asr-004223
02:51:31.720 --> 02:51:34.760
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: public transportation is a necessity and a must.

asr-004224
02:51:35.040 --> 02:51:35.600
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Salamat po.

asr-004225
