asr-004233
02:52:03.500 --> 02:52:10.140
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, the first one po is with regard to the published analysis of the Move As One Coalition

asr-004234
02:52:10.140 --> 02:52:15.740
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: for the fiscal year 2027 National Expenditure Program po,

asr-004235
02:52:16.060 --> 02:52:17.700
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: na nilabas po noong August 18,

asr-004236
02:52:18.240 --> 02:52:22.200
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: kung saan na-flag po yun sa Public Transport Modernization Program na

asr-004237
02:52:22.200 --> 02:52:27.560
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: which fell from 2.5 billion to 176.8 million.

asr-004238
02:52:27.560 --> 02:52:29.940
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And the service contracting,

asr-004239
02:52:30.020 --> 02:52:31.320
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: from 1 billion to 0,

asr-004240
02:52:32.000 --> 02:52:34.880
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: fuel subsidies daw from 2.5 billion to 0,

asr-004241
02:52:34.980 --> 02:52:39.760
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: and the EDSA busway line from 88.7 million to 0.

asr-004242
02:52:40.360 --> 02:52:45.100
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, meron din po kasing letter din po ang Department of Transportation

asr-004243
02:52:45.100 --> 02:52:49.280
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: dated July 23, I think it was reported po before,

asr-004244
02:52:49.920 --> 02:52:52.660
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: which was addressed to the Land Bank and the DBP,

asr-004245
02:52:53.500 --> 02:52:56.000
