asr-004247
02:53:00.020 --> 02:53:04.980
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, yung pangatlong point lang po is yung August reports

asr-004248
02:53:04.980 --> 02:53:10.060
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: that modernized jeepney operators have begun receiving foreclosure letters po

asr-004249
02:53:10.060 --> 02:53:13.560
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: with the LTFRB now negotiating with the banks

asr-004250
02:53:13.560 --> 02:53:17.460
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: and the Department setting aside 1.5 billion for the sector.

asr-004251
02:53:17.600 --> 02:53:19.780
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, yung question ko lang naman po, Mr. Secretary, is

asr-004252
02:53:19.780 --> 02:53:25.600
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: does the current budget po consider the Department's own letter of July 23?

asr-004253
02:53:25.600 --> 02:53:30.000
