asr-004254
02:53:30.020 --> 02:53:34.520
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: to restore the fuel subsidy and the service contracting lines in the proposal po?

asr-004255
02:53:35.780 --> 02:53:36.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004256
02:53:37.760 --> 02:53:38.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes po.

asr-004257
02:53:39.120 --> 02:53:41.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung una po, yung sagutin ko po yung huling tanong,

asr-004258
02:53:41.640 --> 02:53:43.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: if you plan to restore po,

asr-004259
02:53:43.400 --> 02:53:46.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang sagot ko po dyan, ipaglalaban po namin through your help po.

asr-004260
02:53:46.940 --> 02:53:50.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Makikiusap kami na kailangang maibalik yung budget po,

asr-004261
02:53:50.280 --> 02:53:51.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung pondo po dito sa mga programa.

asr-004262
02:53:52.520 --> 02:53:57.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At yung pangalawa po, yung 1.5 billion po na tulong ibibigay natin

asr-004263
02:53:57.600 --> 02:53:59.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: by way of subsidy.

asr-004264
02:54:00.020 --> 02:54:03.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Amortization po ng mga yumakap sa programa natin sa modernization,

asr-004265
02:54:04.000 --> 02:54:06.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay yan po naman ay secured in the sense po na

asr-004266
02:54:06.700 --> 02:54:08.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang alam ko po, nagbigay ng DBF.

asr-004267
02:54:08.700 --> 02:54:11.660
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kanina po nasabi ng NCA,

asr-004268
02:54:11.860 --> 02:54:13.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ng 1 billion po, nabigyan na po tayo,

asr-004269
02:54:14.040 --> 02:54:16.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ibibigay na natin sa LTFRB po yan.

asr-004270
02:54:17.200 --> 02:54:21.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun pa man po, kailangan namin ng karagdagang budget for the 2027.

asr-004271
02:54:22.000 --> 02:54:24.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And of course, with your help po, sir,

asr-004272
02:54:24.860 --> 02:54:27.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sana po mapondohan natin itong service contracting,

asr-004273
02:54:28.160 --> 02:54:29.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: itong PTMP,

asr-004274
02:54:29.160 --> 02:54:32.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at kung may dadagdag natin yung active busway,

asr-004275
02:54:32.640 --> 02:54:33.660
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung fuel subsidy.

asr-004276
02:54:34.040 --> 02:54:36.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kami po ay hihingi po ng inyong tulong.

asr-004277
02:54:37.760 --> 02:54:39.760
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Apo, Mr. Secretary. Maraming salamat po.

asr-004278
02:54:40.240 --> 02:54:43.240
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, of course, we would like to support that endeavor,

asr-004279
02:54:43.400 --> 02:54:45.780
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: lalo na marami pong magbe-benefit po sa ating mga kababayan,

asr-004280
02:54:45.920 --> 02:54:47.000
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: lalo na po yung mga motorista.

asr-004281
02:54:47.780 --> 02:54:50.280
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, yung pangalawang point ko lang po, Mr. Secretary,

asr-004282
02:54:50.480 --> 02:54:54.360
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: is really more of an interagency na matter.

asr-004283
02:54:54.600 --> 02:54:57.300
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, yesterday, I asked the Department of Energy

asr-004284
02:54:57.300 --> 02:54:58.720
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: about the offshore wind,

asr-004285
02:54:59.160 --> 02:55:00.040
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: industry,

asr-004286
02:55:00.300 --> 02:55:06.200
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: and how the government intends to approach their objective

asr-004287
02:55:06.200 --> 02:55:10.840
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: of having 21% of the Philippines' energy supply

asr-004288
02:55:10.840 --> 02:55:13.560
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: come from offshore wind.

asr-004289
02:55:13.940 --> 02:55:16.440
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Pero, a big part of that po, Mr. Secretary,

asr-004290
02:55:16.660 --> 02:55:17.480
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: and I'm sure you'll agree,

asr-004291
02:55:17.680 --> 02:55:21.200
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: is that offshore wind will require a major investment

asr-004292
02:55:21.820 --> 02:55:24.040
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: and effort po when it comes to the ports.

asr-004293
02:55:24.540 --> 02:55:27.840
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, to ensure that the ports po sa Philippines

asr-004294
02:55:27.840 --> 02:55:30.440
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: are ready to accommodate po yung pagdating po

asr-004295
02:55:30.440 --> 02:55:32.580
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: ng mga equipment ng para sa offshore wind.

asr-004296
02:55:33.120 --> 02:55:34.860
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, yung gusto ko lang po malaman,

asr-004297
02:55:35.060 --> 02:55:38.740
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: since natanong ko rin po si Secretary Garin yesterday,

asr-004298
02:55:39.460 --> 02:55:43.040
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: what will the department po direct the ports authority

asr-004299
02:55:43.040 --> 02:55:47.280
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: to program for the Jose Panganiban and the Mercedes po?

asr-004300
02:55:47.600 --> 02:55:50.880
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And is there a timeline so that the ports are ready

asr-004301
02:55:50.880 --> 02:55:56.520
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: before the auctions of the green energy auction po

asr-004302
02:55:56.520 --> 02:55:57.500
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: for the offshore wind?

asr-004303
02:55:57.840 --> 02:55:59.240
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: We'll need them.

asr-004304
02:55:59.420 --> 02:56:01.380
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: The winners for that auction will need them.

asr-004305
02:56:02.020 --> 02:56:04.760
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And, matanong ko na lang din po yung

asr-004306
02:56:04.760 --> 02:56:07.800
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: what does 2027 hold for Matnog Port po

asr-004307
02:56:07.800 --> 02:56:10.320
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: for the Roro Lifeline that carries the traffic

asr-004308
02:56:10.320 --> 02:56:12.160
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: of the two island groups.

asr-004309
02:56:12.340 --> 02:56:13.260
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Marami salamat po, Mr. Secretary.

asr-004310
