DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, before I defer to GMJ po ng PPA po,

asr-004311
02:56:18.440 --> 02:56:20.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: tama po kayo doon sa offshore wind, no?

asr-004312
02:56:20.540 --> 02:56:22.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung suporta po diyan ng DOTr,

asr-004313
02:56:22.420 --> 02:56:23.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ariyan na pa yung napagusapan namin

asr-004314
02:56:23.700 --> 02:56:25.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: since last year po with PPA.

asr-004315
02:56:25.400 --> 02:56:27.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And, definitely po, PPA will,

asr-004316
02:56:27.840 --> 02:56:29.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: give details later.

asr-004317
02:56:29.480 --> 02:56:31.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung pangalawa po yung Matnog Port,

asr-004318
02:56:31.780 --> 02:56:35.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: binisita din po namin yan nung nakaraang taon

asr-004319
02:56:35.340 --> 02:56:37.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at may plano rin po ang PPA na magtayo

asr-004320
02:56:37.920 --> 02:56:40.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ng panibagong terminal din po dyan sa Matnog Port.

asr-004321
02:56:41.120 --> 02:56:43.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Again, Mr. Chairman, may I defer to GMJ po

asr-004322
02:56:43.680 --> 02:56:45.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: for the details of the project.

asr-004323
02:56:46.140 --> 02:56:47.420
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Thank you po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004324
02:56:47.540 --> 02:56:49.140
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Again, with the permission of our Secretary.

asr-004325
02:56:50.100 --> 02:56:53.040
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: To update lang po si Pong Chan

asr-004326
02:56:53.040 --> 02:56:55.920
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: on the two items that he mentioned,

asr-004327
02:56:56.080 --> 02:56:57.040
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: which is the...

asr-004328
02:56:57.840 --> 02:57:00.120
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: doon po sa offshore wind port projects natin,

asr-004329
02:57:00.260 --> 02:57:02.200
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: ang offshore wind port projects po natin,

asr-004330
02:57:02.260 --> 02:57:03.360
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: ang priority po natin,

asr-004331
02:57:03.460 --> 02:57:05.360
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: and which is programmed for this year

asr-004332
02:57:05.360 --> 02:57:08.580
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: in coordination po with the Department of Energy,

