asr-004335
02:57:14.980 --> 02:57:18.280
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So, the contract for the...

asr-004336
02:57:18.280 --> 02:57:20.800
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: for that offshore wind terminal,

asr-004337
02:57:21.120 --> 02:57:21.780
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: your honors,

asr-004338
02:57:22.240 --> 02:57:23.760
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: has already been awarded,

asr-004339
02:57:23.760 --> 02:57:25.100
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: has been bidded out,

asr-004340
02:57:25.160 --> 02:57:25.860
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: and has been awarded.

asr-004341
02:57:26.480 --> 02:57:27.800
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: In fact, we are proud to say that,

asr-004342
02:57:27.800 --> 02:57:33.480
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: yun pong scheme po nung terminal na yun

asr-004343
02:57:33.480 --> 02:57:34.820
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: is on a turnkey basis.

asr-004344
02:57:35.460 --> 02:57:37.800
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So, there is no mobilization,

asr-004345
02:57:38.760 --> 02:57:39.880
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: there is no down payment,

asr-004346
02:57:40.120 --> 02:57:41.360
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: there is no advance payment,

asr-004347
02:57:41.880 --> 02:57:43.980
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: and the government will only pay

asr-004348
02:57:43.980 --> 02:57:48.400
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: after turnover within a period of three years.

asr-004349
02:57:49.200 --> 02:57:49.340
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yan po.

asr-004350
02:57:50.040 --> 02:57:52.960
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And then, that will commence construction po

asr-004351
02:57:52.960 --> 02:57:55.680
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: within, I think, by October.

asr-004352
02:57:55.680 --> 02:57:56.680
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Mag-breakground.

asr-004353
02:57:57.800 --> 02:57:58.680
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Kung na po tayo doon.

asr-004354
02:57:59.220 --> 02:58:01.180
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And in coordination po with the schedule

asr-004355
02:58:01.180 --> 02:58:03.220
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: and timeline of the Department of Energy,

asr-004356
02:58:03.920 --> 02:58:06.380
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: we anticipate that it will be usable

asr-004357
02:58:06.380 --> 02:58:08.960
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: by the service contractors

asr-004358
02:58:08.960 --> 02:58:10.640
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: of the Department of Energy

asr-004359
02:58:10.640 --> 02:58:15.760
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: to enable them to produce the first kilowatt

asr-004360
02:58:15.760 --> 02:58:17.680
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: by 2028,

asr-004361
02:58:17.940 --> 02:58:19.480
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: by the first half of 2028.

asr-004362
02:58:20.740 --> 02:58:23.560
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Doon naman po sa Matnog Port po natin,

asr-004363
02:58:24.220 --> 02:58:27.420
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: we will be bidding out,

asr-004364
02:58:27.800 --> 02:58:31.180
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: the next phase of the expansion of Matnog Port

asr-004365
02:58:31.180 --> 02:58:33.460
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: before the end of the year po,

asr-004366
02:58:33.540 --> 02:58:35.060
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: and we will commence construction there.

asr-004367
02:58:35.240 --> 02:58:36.860
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Ang second phase po natin doon

asr-004368
02:58:36.860 --> 02:58:39.960
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: includes the further expansion of Matnog Port

asr-004369
02:58:39.960 --> 02:58:43.000
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: together with the new passenger terminal building

asr-004370
02:58:43.000 --> 02:58:43.880
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: in Matnog.

asr-004371
02:58:44.420 --> 02:58:46.700
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And then, the subsequent phase po dyan,

asr-004372
02:58:46.820 --> 02:58:47.800
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: which is phase three,

asr-004373
02:58:48.240 --> 02:58:50.540
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: which we will program for next year,

asr-004374
02:58:50.620 --> 02:58:51.720
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: and hopefully by next year,

asr-004375
02:58:52.120 --> 02:58:53.900
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: we can commence phase three

asr-004376
02:58:53.900 --> 02:58:57.060
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: just in time po na matatapos yung phase two natin.

asr-004377
02:58:57.060 --> 02:58:57.140
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Okay.

asr-004378
02:58:57.800 --> 02:59:00.640
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So that will now be the final expansion po,

asr-004379
02:59:00.860 --> 02:59:01.380
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Matnog,

asr-004380
02:59:01.800 --> 02:59:02.720
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: if you are familiar po,

asr-004381
02:59:03.140 --> 02:59:04.000
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Kong, your honor,

asr-004382
02:59:04.680 --> 02:59:07.740
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: kung saan po ngayon yung Matnog Terminal natin,

asr-004383
02:59:08.180 --> 02:59:10.620
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: we will extend that for us full development

asr-004384
02:59:10.620 --> 02:59:13.940
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: all the way doon po sa may coastal road,

asr-004385
02:59:14.200 --> 02:59:16.120
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: kukunin na po natin yung buong yun

asr-004386
02:59:16.120 --> 02:59:17.540
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: for the expansion so that

asr-004387
02:59:17.540 --> 02:59:21.020
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: we will no longer experience na yung mga

asr-004388
02:59:21.020 --> 02:59:22.640
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: biyahero natin

asr-004389
02:59:22.640 --> 02:59:24.720
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: ay nakapila po sa Maharlika Highway

asr-004390
02:59:24.720 --> 02:59:27.460
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: to queue for the vessels po.

asr-004391
02:59:27.800 --> 02:59:29.600
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Doon na po sila paparado sa loob po ng terminal.

asr-004392
02:59:30.220 --> 02:59:31.120
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yun na po, your honors.

asr-004393
02:59:34.540 --> 02:59:36.440
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Actually, yun po, maraming salamat po.

asr-004394
02:59:36.540 --> 02:59:38.160
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Very informative po yung answer niyo, sir.

asr-004395
02:59:38.400 --> 02:59:41.020
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And that would be all, Mr. Chair.

asr-004396
02:59:41.220 --> 02:59:43.440
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And before I end, I would just like to manifest

asr-004397
02:59:43.440 --> 02:59:45.900
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: my full support po for the Department of Transportation.

asr-004398
02:59:46.680 --> 02:59:49.620
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And I think this emphasizes the major role

asr-004399
02:59:49.620 --> 02:59:52.180
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: that the Department of Transportation also has

asr-004400
02:59:52.180 --> 02:59:56.600
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: in the development of our energy infrastructure

asr-004401
02:59:56.600 --> 02:59:58.160
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: and industry in the Philippines.

asr-004402
02:59:58.160 --> 02:59:59.660
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, maraming salamat po.

asr-004403
02:59:59.740 --> 03:00:00.000
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you.

asr-004404
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:04.230
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you, Representative Chan.

asr-004405
03:00:04.870 --> 03:00:08.170
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Next to interpellate is Representative Indy Oaminal.

asr-004406
03:00:10.510 --> 03:00:13.510
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair, and good afternoon to the DOTR family.

asr-004407
03:00:14.010 --> 03:00:23.890
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: To share my concern, I actually discussed this already briefly with the Secretary, but I just want to discuss it further to emphasize the details and to address the said concern.

asr-004408
03:00:23.890 --> 03:00:44.830
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: So to Mr. Chair, our Honorable Secretary, has the Department been made aware of the DEPDEV's Northern Mindanao Plan for 2023 to 2028, wherein it is stated there that there is a need to fast-track the completion of the Ozamiz City Airport modernization?

asr-004409
03:00:48.000 --> 03:00:49.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-004410
03:00:49.960 --> 03:00:56.240
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: And has the Department also, Mr. Chair, been made aware that when our President...

asr-004411
03:00:56.260 --> 03:01:17.680
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: President Ferdinand Bongbong Marcos visited Northern Mindanao back in 2024, specifically in Iligan, he referred to the same plan and explicitly stated that the Ozamiz City modernization is one of the priority projects of his administration to be completed in 2028, Mr. Chair.

asr-004412
03:01:18.300 --> 03:01:19.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-004413
03:01:20.000 --> 03:01:21.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, hindi naman parang cross-examination dito.

asr-004414
03:01:21.960 --> 03:01:23.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes or no, can I explain, Mr. Chair?

asr-004415
03:01:24.000 --> 03:01:25.180
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Pero sige po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004416
03:01:25.180 --> 03:01:26.180
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Just laying down...

asr-004417
03:01:26.260 --> 03:01:27.440
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Just laying down some basis, Mr. Chair.

asr-004418
03:01:27.560 --> 03:01:27.720
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Okay.

asr-004419
03:01:28.100 --> 03:01:46.480
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: And as an item in the DEPDEV's priority plan and as a priority project as stated by the President, I just want to ask, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary, how much was funded in the DOTR budget for the Ozamiz City Airport in 2023?

asr-004420
03:02:05.020 --> 03:02:05.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: 2023.

asr-004421
03:02:06.340 --> 03:02:10.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Can I defer to our implementing unit, at least for the funding?

asr-004422
03:02:10.200 --> 03:02:11.720
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Yes, of course, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary.

asr-004423
03:02:18.820 --> 03:02:24.680
DOTr Director Eduardo J. Mangalili: Your Honor, sir, for... from DOTR, we don't have allocation in 2023.

asr-004424
03:02:25.680 --> 03:02:28.280
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: What about in 2024, Mr. Chair?

asr-004425
03:02:31.600 --> 03:02:37.380
DOTr Director Eduardo J. Mangalili: Okay, sir, to further clarify, from 2023 onward, DOTR has no fund for this.

asr-004426
03:02:37.460 --> 03:02:43.040
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: So, even though the airport was identified as a priority project from 2023 onwards, but

asr-004427
03:02:43.040 --> 03:02:43.980
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: wala pong...

asr-004428
03:02:43.980 --> 03:02:45.280
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Did I hear that correct, Mr. Chair?

asr-004429
03:02:45.340 --> 03:02:47.860
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Wala pong pondo na-allocate for it sa DOTR budget.

asr-004430
03:02:48.220 --> 03:02:48.700
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Tama po ba?

asr-004431
03:02:48.700 --> 03:02:50.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We confirm, Mr. Chair.

asr-004432
03:02:51.340 --> 03:02:54.360
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: So, paano po kaya yan nangyari, Mr. Chair?

asr-004433
03:02:54.420 --> 03:02:57.240
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: I have my own theories, but I also want to hear from the department.

asr-004434
03:02:57.680 --> 03:02:59.560
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: And I don't mean to point any fingers.

asr-004435
03:03:00.100 --> 03:03:04.580
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: I especially don't want to blame or point the finger at our Honorable Secretary, considering

asr-004436
03:03:04.580 --> 03:03:07.600
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: luma na po yung plan na to and he was just recently appointed.

asr-004437
03:03:08.080 --> 03:03:14.480
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Na may plano na po sa DEPDEV, nabanggit din po ng Pangulo mismo, pero hindi po talaga siya

asr-004438
03:03:14.480 --> 03:03:17.720
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: baga natutukan at napondohan, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary.

asr-004439
03:03:19.180 --> 03:03:21.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Could only be two things, Mr. Chair.

asr-004440
03:03:21.340 --> 03:03:30.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung limited fiscal space po ng gobyerno at yung obligation and utilization rate po ng

asr-004441
03:03:30.120 --> 03:03:31.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: isang kagawaran.

asr-004442
03:03:31.540 --> 03:03:36.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Usually, yun po ang nangiging basehan kung bakit kahit may mga proposan, other than kapag

asr-004443
03:03:36.820 --> 03:03:42.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: unless hindi siya shovel-ready na sinasabi, implementation-ready ang mga proyektong to.

asr-004444
03:03:42.360 --> 03:03:47.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero kahit na ganun pong implementation-ready siya, meron pong dalawang mabigat na rason

asr-004445
03:03:47.360 --> 03:03:51.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kung bakit minsan hindi po nabibigyan ng pondo ang isang proyektong to.

asr-004446
03:03:51.340 --> 03:03:56.320
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Ano po yung isa pang rason, Mr. Chair, if I may ask?

asr-004447
03:03:57.900 --> 03:04:05.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yun po, limited fiscal space and the second one is the very low utilization or obligation rate

asr-004448
03:04:05.960 --> 03:04:10.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: of isang department o kagawaran po.

asr-004449
03:04:10.980 --> 03:04:15.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So parang DOTR, hindi ko po sinasabi na mababa ang kanilang at that time.

asr-004450
03:04:15.240 --> 03:04:21.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Maari po yung dalawang yun ang nagiging rason at hindi nabibigyan po ng pondo.

asr-004451
03:04:21.340 --> 03:04:22.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang isang kagawaran.

asr-004452
03:04:23.140 --> 03:04:24.700
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: I'll move on for a while, Mr. Chair.

asr-004453
03:04:25.180 --> 03:04:28.140
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Kumusta naman po sa 2027 na NEP po, Mr. Chair?

asr-004454
03:04:28.460 --> 03:04:30.720
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Magkano po yun ang allot for the Ozamiz City Airport?

asr-004455
03:04:32.020 --> 03:04:40.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kahit kami po ay humingi pa rin po, budget proposal, at hindi po kami nabigyan sa NEP po natin ng pondo para sa Ozamiz Airport.

asr-004456
03:04:41.120 --> 03:04:47.100
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: And magkano po, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary, yung nahingi po sana to DBM for the Ozamiz City Airport?

asr-004457
03:04:47.100 --> 03:04:51.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If I'm not mistaken, subject to the actual number, around P300 million.

asr-004458
03:04:51.340 --> 03:05:01.380
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: And if I may also ask, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary, magkano pa po yung kailangan para matapos po yung modernization talaga ng Ozamiz Airport?

asr-004459
03:05:12.020 --> 03:05:21.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, can we get back to you, Mr. Chair, as to the actual amount that we need for the entire rehab and modernization of Ozamiz Airport?

asr-004460
03:05:21.660 --> 03:05:25.900
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: I have a number in my notes, Mr. Chair. Maybe we can just add the CAAP to confirm.

asr-004461
03:05:26.280 --> 03:05:28.980
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: 2.1 billion pesos around that much pa po.

asr-004462
03:05:28.980 --> 03:05:30.740
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Can the CAAP confirm, Mr. Chair?

asr-004463
03:05:31.100 --> 03:05:37.820
CAAP Assistant Director General Valentino A. Dionela: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004464
03:05:38.380 --> 03:05:50.200
CAAP Assistant Director General Valentino A. Dionela: Tama po yung this is the ballpark figure, 2.1 billion na kung saan dinaplano na dito makakakuan sa CAAP corporate operating budget.

asr-004465
03:05:50.780 --> 03:05:56.620
CAAP Assistant Director General Valentino A. Dionela: But depende pa rin po doon sa approval ng higher authorities, which is the OTR.

asr-004466
03:05:57.280 --> 03:06:00.720
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: So yung kailangan pa po, Mr. Chair, is 2.1 billion.

asr-004467
03:06:01.600 --> 03:06:05.360
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: So ibig sabihin po, yung 300 na request, kukulang pa rin po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004468
03:06:06.060 --> 03:06:09.640
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Para matapos yung modernization ng Ozamiz Airport.

asr-004469
03:06:09.840 --> 03:06:19.800
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Tanong ko na lang rin po, Mr. Chair, itong 2.1 billion po na to ba, kaya po ba itong pondohan ng CAAP alone, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary, or representatives from the CAAP?

asr-004470
03:06:23.550 --> 03:06:28.430
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So one-time budget po, hindi po kakayanin ng CAAP po.

asr-004471
03:06:29.350 --> 03:06:34.150
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: So ano po kaya yung action ng department, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary?

asr-004472
03:06:34.650 --> 03:06:36.390
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: We're here to look for solutions.

asr-004473
03:06:37.630 --> 03:06:43.530
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Yung nasabi po ng Pangulo, and I really remember that because I was Mayor of Ozamiz at that time,

asr-004474
03:06:44.350 --> 03:06:48.550
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: kasama po sa priority niya, yung Ozamiz Airport na matapos by 2028,

asr-004475
03:06:49.330 --> 03:06:51.930
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: ay kaya pa po natin numahabol na.

asr-004476
03:06:51.990 --> 03:06:58.250
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Kahit pa paano ma-modernize po yung Ozamiz Airport before the President's term end, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary.

asr-004477
03:06:58.750 --> 03:07:06.430
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Una po, kaya po kami nakipagtulungan po sa Committee on Appropriations kasi alam po namin na may mga ibang,

asr-004478
03:07:06.430 --> 03:07:12.990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ibang mga locally funded projects na hindi po nabigyan ng pondo, tulad lang din po ng Ozamiz Airport.

asr-004479
03:07:13.650 --> 03:07:22.770
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun pa man po, bilang prioridad na airport po ito na paliparan, at ito po ay isang utos rin ng ating mahal na Pangulo,

asr-004480
03:07:22.770 --> 03:07:33.690
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang CAAP naman po ay yearly naglalagay kami ng budget from the Corporate Operating Budget of CAAP upang sa ganun matuloy lang natin ang proyekto.

asr-004481
03:07:34.450 --> 03:07:35.770
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ito'y tumatagal nga lamang.

asr-004482
03:07:36.430 --> 03:07:44.690
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ay limitado din ang pondo ng CAAP at magiging malaking tulong kung mabigyan naman po ang kagawaran ng transportation through GAAP.

asr-004483
03:07:45.310 --> 03:07:49.270
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: We are willing to work with the Department on that, of course, Mr. Chair.

asr-004484
03:07:49.270 --> 03:08:03.810
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: But in terms of the CAAP funding, Mr. Chair, would it be possible to know, ano po po ba kaya talagang gawin ng CAAP in terms of the modernization ng Ozamiz Airport during the remainder of the current term po, Mr. Chair, Honorable Secretary?

asr-004485
03:08:03.810 --> 03:08:06.410
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May I defer to CAAP?

asr-004486
03:08:06.430 --> 03:08:12.430
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung magkano ang kanilang na-allocate na budget for 2026, 2027, at least for the Ozamiz?

asr-004487
03:08:13.110 --> 03:08:19.570
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: The question would be, Mr. Chair and Honorable Secretary, magkano pa po kaya yung pwede nilang ma-allocate?

asr-004488
03:08:19.850 --> 03:08:25.410
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: We are aware na po magkano yung na-allocate na nila for 2026 and we're very appreciative of CAAP for that.

asr-004489
03:08:25.570 --> 03:08:32.790
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: They're really doing what they can to do their part in completing the Ozamiz modernization project.

asr-004490
03:08:32.790 --> 03:08:36.410
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Pero after po yung nabigyan nila for 2026, magkano?

asr-004491
03:08:36.430 --> 03:08:40.910
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Paano pa po talaga yung kaya nila magbigay para matapos tong project na to sa Ozamiz?

asr-004492
03:08:43.630 --> 03:08:45.230
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: If I may, Mr. Chair, magandang hapon po.

asr-004493
03:08:45.930 --> 03:08:59.730
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: From CAAP po, I'm confirming po meron po tayong na-allocate na 169 million for site acquisition and for the construction of PTB, which amounts to 300 million for Phase 1.

asr-004494
03:08:59.890 --> 03:09:01.850
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Mr. Chair, I'm sorry, I'll just interject.

asr-004495
03:09:02.170 --> 03:09:06.370
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Yung question ko po is for onwards, hindi po yung sa 2026.

asr-004496
03:09:06.370 --> 03:09:06.850
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Yes, po.

asr-004497
03:09:07.050 --> 03:09:08.090
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Just a second.

asr-004498
03:09:08.090 --> 03:09:11.510
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: So, yan pong figures na sinasabi mo, that's for 2027?

asr-004499
03:09:12.410 --> 03:09:18.590
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: For 2027 po, meron po tayong na-allocate po na, for Asphalt Overlay, for Phase 2 na po ng ano sana.

asr-004500
03:09:19.270 --> 03:09:23.590
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Meron po tayong 891 million na na-allocate hanggang 2028 po.

asr-004501
03:09:23.990 --> 03:09:25.350
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: How much po hanggang 2028?

asr-004502
03:09:26.030 --> 03:09:27.950
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: 891 po yung naka-lagay po.

asr-004503
03:09:28.170 --> 03:09:30.830
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: That's on top of the allocated for 2026?

asr-004504
03:09:31.210 --> 03:09:36.570
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Yes, part po ng mga na-allocate po sa 2026, including for the PTB and part of the Asphalt Overlay.

asr-004505
03:09:36.570 --> 03:09:36.970
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Thank you.

asr-004506
03:09:36.970 --> 03:09:38.070
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Yung tanong ko po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004507
03:09:38.090 --> 03:09:49.410
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Maliban po sa na-allocate na for 2026, pagkano pa po yung kaya i-tulong ng KAAP from 2027 until the end of this current term po, Mr. Chair?

asr-004508
03:09:49.410 --> 03:10:12.190
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: As of now, Mr. Chair, ang napag-usapan na po through the Chair is that at the very least, meron po tayong ma-allocate po, at least for the price increase ng costing po sa initial mo, which is,

asr-004509
03:10:12.190 --> 03:10:14.010
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: naging increase po kasi ng from 300.

asr-004510
03:10:14.170 --> 03:10:15.510
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Naging 450.

asr-004511
03:10:16.150 --> 03:10:21.690
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: So, yun po, ikukunin na rin po namin sa COB yung increase ng price that was certified by DPWH.

asr-004512
03:10:22.110 --> 03:10:23.630
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Yun po yung na-commit ng ating Director General.

asr-004513
03:10:23.790 --> 03:10:30.250
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Pero pinag-aaralan din po namin, Mr. Chair, kung kaya rin po sana ma-include yung control tower and yung lighting po.

asr-004514
03:10:30.450 --> 03:10:34.050
CAAP Assistant Director General Atty. Roberto Martin S. Buenaventura: Pero pinag-aaralan po po kung kaya po ng COB ng CAAP, Mr. Chair.

asr-004515
03:10:34.050 --> 03:10:37.370
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Sabanggit po, Mr. Chair, yung control tower and lighting.

asr-004516
03:10:37.670 --> 03:10:44.090
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Tama po, nasa plano po ng CAAP na kasama sa modernization is yung pag-night rate ng Ozamiz Airport.

asr-004517
03:10:44.170 --> 03:10:49.370
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Tanong ko lang po sa department, kaya pa po ba natin yung mahabol by 2028, Mr. Chair?

asr-004518
03:10:51.090 --> 03:10:56.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kapag nagbigyan po kami ng tamang pondo at sapat na pondo, abulin po namin.

asr-004519
03:10:56.310 --> 03:10:59.130
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: We will work with you on that, Honorable Secretary.

asr-004520
03:10:59.290 --> 03:11:07.630
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: But in terms of yung sa CAAP, maliban sa funding po, yung completion po mismo, kasi gusto po natin na night-rated, hindi lang may pondo.

asr-004521
03:11:07.630 --> 03:11:13.470
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: But na puwede na po talaga makalipad sa gabi para mabawasan yung congestion sa terminal.

asr-004522
03:11:14.170 --> 03:11:30.090
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, ito po, yan naman ay binibigyan ng prioridad ng CAAP natin.

asr-004523
03:11:30.090 --> 03:11:41.410
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sinasabi po natin ngayon, gustuin man ng DOT or CAAP na pondoan lahat ang isang paliparan, alam din namin yung pangangailangan ng mga iba't-ibang paliparan sa Pilipinas po.

asr-004524
03:11:41.650 --> 03:11:43.470
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, I think I understand CAAP.

asr-004525
03:11:43.550 --> 03:11:44.090
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Datikin at kumisipin.

asr-004526
03:11:44.170 --> 03:11:48.830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: What is the specific amount po that they can give for 2027?

asr-004527
03:11:49.410 --> 03:11:57.290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If it's, I beg your intelligence, Your Honor, if we can get back to you, kasi it's a CAAP, it's a board.

asr-004528
03:11:57.650 --> 03:12:03.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We cannot decide on one thing as an operating budget without consulting and approval of the other board.

asr-004529
03:12:03.310 --> 03:12:07.470
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Otherwise, we can say an amount, pero maglalabas po na nang bobola po kami dito.

asr-004530
03:12:07.650 --> 03:12:10.010
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Let's get back to you, Your Honor, Mr. Chairman.

asr-004531
03:12:10.010 --> 03:12:11.330
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Mr. Chairman, I can leave it at that.

asr-004532
03:12:11.510 --> 03:12:14.090
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: And I just hope that the board will recognize.

asr-004533
03:12:14.170 --> 03:12:29.090
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: This need as identified by the DEPDev and the President, and they can consider doing what they can, funding what they can, para kahit papano, hindi lang na matapos yung PTB, maging night-rated rin po yung Ozamiz Airport before the President's terms end.

asr-004534
03:12:29.870 --> 03:12:34.250
Rep. Henry "Indy" F. Oaminal Jr.: Mr. Chair, lastly, I just want to address the PPA for a while.

asr-004535
