Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Siyempre naiinggit po ako sa ibang mga kasama ko na puro papuri, puro pasasalamat sa lahat po ng effort ng DOTr sa kani-kanilang mga distrito. Siyempre gusto ko ring magpasalamat sa lahat, pero wala akong mahanap para ipagpasalamat eh. Talaga eh. Minsan nagtataka ako, ano bang nagawa ko

asr-004667
03:24:36.280 --> 03:24:39.000
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: to deserve the kind of treatment that uh

asr-004668
03:24:39.400 --> 03:24:46.520
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: our district gets from the dotr i don't like uh talking about this in public because there's just

asr-004669
03:24:46.520 --> 03:24:54.200
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: so many other problems that we have to face and uh frankly i hesitated but uh since i'm under a

asr-004670
03:24:54.200 --> 03:25:03.000
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: time limit anyway so this is not going to be a long soliloquy but uh i've obviously i've been

asr-004671
03:25:03.000 --> 03:25:23.320
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: looking at the—siyempre nagpapakahirap po kami sa Ways and Means para humanap ng pera, humanap ng pondo. Binabatikos kami ng iba't ibang sektor dahil naglalabas kami ng iba't ibang mga buwis na tingin naming kinakailangan to make our economic development sustainable to fund all these programs.

asr-004672
03:25:23.320 --> 03:25:35.640
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So nagkakandara pa po kami diyan, pero sana man lang makinabang din yung aming distrito. Nakikita natin yung utilization ng DOTr.

asr-004673
03:25:35.640 --> 03:25:50.840
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Hindi lang naman kayo eh. Even previous administrations, talagang napakababa ng utilization for one reason or the other. Ang isa sa mga dahilan diyan, may mga iba kayong ahensya na nasa ilalim sa inyo na independent republics

asr-004674
03:25:50.840 --> 03:26:02.840
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: na hindi sumusunod sa inyo basta-basta, PPA, mga ganyan. Yan ay magaling at mabait na kaklase ko po yan sa UP College of Law.

asr-004675
03:26:03.000 --> 03:26:15.960
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Anyway, so is it the policy of the DOTR in terms of, is construction of all these bikeways, transportation in the metropolis,

asr-004676
03:26:15.960 --> 03:26:23.620
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: is it now the policy to download or to delegate this function to the LGUs?

asr-004677
03:26:24.000 --> 03:26:26.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Is it now the policy of the DOTR?

asr-004678
03:26:26.160 --> 03:26:35.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may po. Una po, malaking pasalamat po namin sa Kongreso, sa mga distrito,

asr-004679
03:26:35.880 --> 03:26:40.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kasi sila po'y talagang nagbibigay ng pondo pagdating sa active transport po natin.

asr-004680
03:26:42.300 --> 03:26:51.660
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Para sagutin po kung ito ay polisiya, nakasaad din po sa special provision po natin sa batas, sa GAA,

asr-004681
03:26:52.280 --> 03:26:55.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung pakikipag-coordinate po sa mga

asr-004682
03:26:56.160 --> 03:27:00.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: city or munisipyo pagdating sa active transport.

asr-004683
03:27:01.160 --> 03:27:10.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Not really a policy, pero ito po kasi sa tingin namin para mas mapabilis ang aming disbursement obligation,

asr-004684
03:27:10.840 --> 03:27:16.720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kasi po hinahabol namin talaga sa sobrang dami po ng ating mga proyekto.

asr-004685
03:27:17.500 --> 03:27:25.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Minamabuti po minsan namin na pumunta po sa isang LGU para po mai-download namin ang mga ganitong klaseng proyekto

asr-004686
03:27:26.160 --> 03:27:30.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na pinunduhan po talaga ng Kongreso.

asr-004687
03:27:31.160 --> 03:27:35.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Kasi tinitingnan ko yung Local Government Code. It's not a devolved function eh.

asr-004688
03:27:35.160 --> 03:27:37.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So practically it is.

asr-004689
03:27:37.160 --> 03:27:44.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So kung ganun lang naman, sabihin niyo na sa amin para imbes na ipasa na namin sa DOTr, kayo nahihirapan,

asr-004690
03:27:44.160 --> 03:27:50.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: i-direkta na natin as part of the allotment ng LGUs pagdating dito.

asr-004691
03:27:50.160 --> 03:27:55.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Kasi otherwise, kung kayo nahihirapan diyan, ba't ba natin dadalhin sa inyo? Nagdo-double handling pa.

asr-004692
03:27:55.160 --> 03:27:56.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: That is the point.

asr-004693
03:27:56.160 --> 03:27:58.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: If that is the policy or stand of the DOTr,

asr-004694
03:27:58.160 --> 03:28:04.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: sabihin niyo na po sa amin para at least alam namin, hindi na namin kayo pahirapan. Secretary,

asr-004695
03:28:04.160 --> 03:28:07.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It's not a policy po, Mr. Chairman.

asr-004696
03:28:07.160 --> 03:28:18.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang nangyayari po minsan, meron pong request ang ating mga lokal na pamahalaan na gusto rin naman nilang mag-implement ng ganitong active transport.

asr-004697
03:28:18.160 --> 03:28:25.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung mayroon man kaming kakulangan po, shortcoming sa ganitong pag-i-implement, kung hindi po tama yung pananaw namin

asr-004698
03:28:25.160 --> 03:28:33.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na para mas mapabilis ang pag-i-implement ng proyekto at makikipagtulungan kami sa mga LGU po,

asr-004699
03:28:33.160 --> 03:28:36.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: eh aayusin po namin ang aming polisiya.

asr-004700
03:28:36.160 --> 03:28:43.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero hindi po namin makakalimutan na nangyayari lang po ito, napondo dahil pinunduhan po ng mga kinatawan ng mga distrito.

asr-004701
03:28:43.160 --> 03:28:51.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So kung iyan ay nagiging direksyon, maaari din bang i-download iyan sa kanila?

asr-004702
03:28:51.160 --> 03:28:52.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Yes.

asr-004703
03:28:52.160 --> 03:28:53.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ilang beses na po na kay

asr-004704
03:28:53.160 --> 03:28:54.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: To Secretary Bautista?

asr-004705
03:28:54.160 --> 03:28:57.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Secretary Bautista humingi po ng dispensa.

asr-004706
03:28:57.160 --> 03:28:59.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Sabi, huwag mag-alala.

asr-004707
03:28:59.160 --> 03:29:01.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Nawala si Secretary Bautista.

asr-004708
03:29:01.160 --> 03:29:04.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Nag-request ako kay Secretary Vince.

asr-004709
03:29:04.160 --> 03:29:05.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Sumulat ako patungkol

asr-004710
03:29:05.160 --> 03:29:09.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: uli sa parehong bagay.

asr-004711
03:29:09.160 --> 03:29:14.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Sumulat ako sa kanya nung nakaraang taon, April at July of 2025.

asr-004712
03:29:14.160 --> 03:29:15.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Usap kami.

asr-004713
03:29:15.160 --> 03:29:16.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Okay, no problem.

asr-004714
03:29:16.160 --> 03:29:17.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Nawala siya.

asr-004715
03:29:17.160 --> 03:29:19.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Kayo po ang pumalit.

asr-004716
03:29:19.160 --> 03:29:22.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Nagulat na lang po ako that that same request, in-approve, was now being

asr-004717
03:29:22.160 --> 03:29:23.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: implemented.

asr-004718
03:29:23.160 --> 03:29:25.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Nababalitaan ko na lang afterwards.

asr-004719
03:29:25.160 --> 03:29:29.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So sabi ko sa mga kasama ko, papaano ito?

asr-004720
03:29:29.160 --> 03:29:31.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Tayo nag-a-approve ng budget.

asr-004721
03:29:31.160 --> 03:29:38.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: How are we able to perform our oversight functions when we don't even get invited to the occasion

asr-004722
03:29:38.160 --> 03:29:43.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: where it is nag-groundbreaking or kahit nagbe-blessing?

asr-004723
03:29:43.160 --> 03:29:46.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Nalalaman na lang po namin sa iba.

asr-004724
03:29:46.160 --> 03:29:51.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So mahirap po kasi, siyempre it's also part of our function, you have to understand,

asr-004725
03:29:51.160 --> 03:29:54.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: na makita kung nai-implement ba ng tama

asr-004726
03:29:54.160 --> 03:29:58.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: para purihin po namin kayo dahil masipag, marami kayong ginagawa.

asr-004727
03:29:58.160 --> 03:30:00.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Pero paano namin mapupuri

asr-004728
03:30:00.160 --> 03:30:03.480
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: kung hindi namin nakikita kung paano ito nagagawa.

asr-004729
03:30:04.940 --> 03:30:08.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At tama po Mr. Chairman, iyan po ay pagkakamali sa aking panig.

asr-004730
03:30:09.140 --> 03:30:13.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pagdating po kasi sa mga inauguration, sa mga groundbreaking,

asr-004731
03:30:14.000 --> 03:30:16.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: hindi ko na po chinecheck yung details po.

asr-004732
03:30:16.880 --> 03:30:20.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero mula po nung tama po kayo, nung tinawagan nyo po ako,

asr-004733
03:30:20.520 --> 03:30:23.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at sinabi nyo nga po na may ganito mga pangyayari,

asr-004734
03:30:23.600 --> 03:30:25.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ako po ay humingi ka agad ng paumanhin.

asr-004735
03:30:26.040 --> 03:30:29.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ang gagawin ko nga po ngayon, nakaugalihan ko na rin po,

asr-004736
03:30:29.300 --> 03:30:32.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na iche-check ko na lang po parati yung mga invitation.

asr-004737
03:30:32.520 --> 03:30:36.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: My general instruction is always to invite everyone po.

asr-004738
03:30:37.200 --> 03:30:41.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ang tingin kasi namin ay isang proyekto ay para sa isang komunidad.

asr-004739
03:30:42.380 --> 03:30:49.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At sana lahat po ng mga leader at pinuno sa lugar na yan ay maimbitahan po.

asr-004740
03:30:50.300 --> 03:30:53.500
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Hindi lang, ang imbitasyon ay isang mababaw na bagay.

asr-004741
03:30:53.640 --> 03:30:55.560
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Pero ibig sabihin nyo, active participation.

asr-004742
03:30:55.560 --> 03:30:58.560
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So that we know that the funds for which we are being supported,

asr-004743
03:30:59.300 --> 03:31:02.680
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: sought, for which kami nanguhusgan, ay nagagamit ng tama.

asr-004744
03:31:03.120 --> 03:31:06.540
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Yan lang naman po ang, hindi naman yung magpakita ka daw, magpapicture.

asr-004745
03:31:06.860 --> 03:31:08.580
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: That's not really the most relevant thing.

asr-004746
03:31:08.860 --> 03:31:14.280
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: It is the proper use of funds entrusted to us in the pursuit of our,

asr-004747
03:31:15.600 --> 03:31:19.920
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: as the, having the power of the purse, Secretary.

asr-004748
03:31:20.800 --> 03:31:22.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I fully agree po.

asr-004749
03:31:22.100 --> 03:31:26.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po makikiusap kami na ngayon po sa special provision po natin nangga.

asr-004750
03:31:26.720 --> 03:31:29.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sana po mabigyan nyo pa na kami ng mas malawak.

asr-004751
03:31:29.300 --> 03:31:36.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Na pabaga opportunity so that we can download it to the proper barangay.

asr-004752
03:31:36.520 --> 03:31:42.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At sa ganun din po we can report po dun sa mga congressman na talaga nagbigay ng pondo

asr-004753
03:31:42.640 --> 03:31:46.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at talaga sila yung nagsumikap na maglagay ng pondo sa DOTR po.

asr-004754
03:31:46.940 --> 03:31:48.240
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: My time is up.

asr-004755
03:31:49.580 --> 03:31:52.960
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ayoko na po masyadong mag-consume ng time.

asr-004756
03:31:53.660 --> 03:31:57.420
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Pero sana lang is kapag dinadownload natin ito,

asr-004757
03:31:57.420 --> 03:31:58.420
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: sa kahit anumang,

asr-004763
03:31:59.160 --> 03:32:02.300
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: whether it's a DPWH,

asr-004764
03:32:02.640 --> 03:32:03.740
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: whether it's an LGU,

asr-004765
03:32:04.220 --> 03:32:06.980
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: na mamonitor natin kung tama ang pagkakagamit.

asr-004766
03:32:07.120 --> 03:32:09.580
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Because sa ating mga colleagues,

asr-004767
03:32:09.740 --> 03:32:10.560
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: sa ating mga,

asr-004768
03:32:11.220 --> 03:32:15.480
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: mahirap kapag nasa third district ka ng Quezon City,

asr-004769
03:32:16.020 --> 03:32:17.980
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: chairman ka ng committee on transportation,

asr-004770
03:32:18.740 --> 03:32:21.140
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: pupunta ka nalang bigla sa barangay Socorro

asr-004771
03:32:21.140 --> 03:32:23.300
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: o kaya sa barangay Escopa,

asr-004772
03:32:23.960 --> 03:32:24.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: di ba?

asr-004773
03:32:24.280 --> 03:32:26.060
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Babalitaan ka ng mga leaders mo na,

asr-004774
03:32:26.060 --> 03:32:26.960
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: oh wala ka dito,

asr-004775
03:32:27.260 --> 03:32:29.060
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: chairman ng transportation,

asr-004776
03:32:29.160 --> 03:32:31.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: nagkuhuno dito tungkol DOTR,

asr-004777
03:32:31.160 --> 03:32:32.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: nandito po.

asr-004778
03:32:32.160 --> 03:32:32.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Sabi ko,

asr-004779
03:32:32.660 --> 03:32:34.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: eh buti pa kayo na-meet niyo ng sekretary.

asr-004780
03:32:34.660 --> 03:32:35.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ako never ko pa na-meet.

asr-004781
03:32:35.660 --> 03:32:37.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: matagal ko nang gustong makilala yan

asr-004782
03:32:37.660 --> 03:32:38.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: dahil balita ako,

asr-004783
03:32:38.660 --> 03:32:39.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: magaling,

asr-004784
03:32:39.660 --> 03:32:41.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: mabilis mag-implement,

asr-004785
03:32:41.160 --> 03:32:42.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: at bukod sa lahat,

asr-004786
03:32:42.160 --> 03:32:47.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: ayan ay talagang kapartner sa pagpapatupad ng magagandang proyekto

asr-004787
03:32:47.160 --> 03:32:52.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: at kinikilalaan na tayo ang pinagagalingan ng budget.

asr-004788
03:32:52.160 --> 03:32:53.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Tingin ko naman,

asr-004789
03:32:53.160 --> 03:32:55.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: hindi rin maikasasama kung sabihin ko na

asr-004790
03:32:55.160 --> 03:32:58.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: magkakaroon ng konting tampo si congressman,

asr-004791
03:32:58.160 --> 03:32:59.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: si congressman,

asr-004792
03:32:59.100 --> 03:33:00.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Franz Pumaren.

asr-004793
03:33:00.100 --> 03:33:01.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Buti na lang po ako,

asr-004794
03:33:01.100 --> 03:33:03.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: hindi ako kasing tampuhin niya.

asr-004795
03:33:03.100 --> 03:33:06.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Pero matandain po ako,

asr-004796
03:33:06.100 --> 03:33:08.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: hindi po ako matampuhin.

asr-004797
03:33:08.100 --> 03:33:10.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Salamat po Mr. Chairman,

asr-004798
03:33:10.100 --> 03:33:15.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at ulitin ko po na kung mayroon pang pagkukulang ang kagawaran ng transportation,

asr-004799
03:33:15.100 --> 03:33:16.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kasama po,

asr-004800
03:33:16.100 --> 03:33:18.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: nasaan po na kay mga USEC,

asr-004801
03:33:18.100 --> 03:33:21.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ASEC po, ako po ay humingi ng paumanhin.

asr-004802
03:33:21.100 --> 03:33:22.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Okay na po ako dyan,

asr-004803
03:33:22.100 --> 03:33:23.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: hindi na po,

asr-004804
03:33:23.100 --> 03:33:24.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: basta magkatulong tayo,

asr-004805
03:33:24.100 --> 03:33:26.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: we work,

asr-004806
03:33:26.100 --> 03:33:27.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: we move forward.

asr-004807
03:33:27.100 --> 03:33:28.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Kung ano yung kaunlad natin,

asr-004808
03:33:28.100 --> 03:33:30.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: nakikiusap lang ako na

asr-004809
03:33:30.100 --> 03:33:32.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: itrato niyo kaming partner

asr-004810
03:33:32.100 --> 03:33:35.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: at hindi kami balakid sa inyong mga gawain.

asr-004811
03:33:35.100 --> 03:33:37.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Maraming salamat Mr. Chairman

asr-004812
03:33:37.100 --> 03:33:40.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: to the best ever governor of the great province

asr-004813
03:33:40.100 --> 03:33:41.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: of Northern Samar,

asr-004814
03:33:41.100 --> 03:33:43.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Maupay Nga Kulop Mano.

asr-004815
03:33:43.100 --> 03:33:46.100
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you, Chairman Kimbo.

asr-004816
03:33:46.100 --> 03:33:47.100
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Next?

asr-004817
03:33:47.100 --> 03:33:50.100
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Next to interpelate is

asr-004818
03:33:50.100 --> 03:33:55.960
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: congressman Moniz Pares.

asr-004819
03:33:55.960 --> 03:33:57.960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004820
03:33:57.960 --> 03:33:58.960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: And,

asr-004821
03:33:58.960 --> 03:34:00.960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: good evening sa ating lahat,

