asr-005212
03:44:26.250 --> 03:44:28.250
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Maaari pong ulitin, ah,

asr-005213
03:44:28.250 --> 03:44:29.250
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Mr. Chair.

asr-005214
03:44:29.250 --> 03:44:32.250
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Di ba, may budget tayo sa 2026 for the PTMP,

asr-005215
03:44:32.250 --> 03:44:34.250
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: 1.5 billion,

asr-005216
03:44:34.250 --> 03:44:35.250
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: ah,

asr-005217
03:44:35.250 --> 03:44:36.250
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: budget.

asr-005218
03:44:36.250 --> 03:44:37.250
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, ang tanong ko dito,

asr-005219
03:44:37.250 --> 03:44:39.250
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: ilan ang na-utilize na natin?

asr-005220
03:44:39.250 --> 03:44:42.600
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Kasama po yun sa i-da-download namin, ah,

asr-005221
03:44:42.600 --> 03:44:44.600
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Mr. Chair.

asr-005222
03:44:44.600 --> 03:44:45.600
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Wala kayong data?

asr-005223
03:44:45.600 --> 03:44:47.600
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kung ilan ang nagamit na ninyo?

asr-005224
03:45:22.700 --> 03:45:27.420
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Hindi ba ready ang agency for that? Kasi utilization naman ang pinag-usapan natin dito.

asr-005225
03:45:35.460 --> 03:45:36.460
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: I mean the 1.5B?

asr-005226
03:45:36.460 --> 03:45:45.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes. Tama po at nabigyan na po kami ng NCA para sa 1.5B po na yung sinasabi nating PTMP.

asr-005227
03:45:46.700 --> 03:45:55.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ibibigay na po natin sa LTFRB po para po iyon po yung pagbibigay po ng subsidiya dito sa mga yumakap po sa programa.

asr-005228
03:45:55.460 --> 03:46:02.460
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kaya gusto ko, Secretary Tingnan, ilan na yung na-utilize ninyo for 2026? Kasi 1.5B yun.

asr-005229
03:46:03.100 --> 03:46:11.520
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Now, related dun, kasi magtanong ako dito, bakit sa 2027 NEP ninyo sobrang baba na ng pondo ninyo?

asr-005230
03:46:12.240 --> 03:46:19.900
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So tanong is, baka hindi nyo ginamit yung 1.5B, kaya binigyan kayo ngayon ng 176M na lang instead of a billion.

asr-005231
03:46:20.720 --> 03:46:23.060
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Dahil hindi nyo ginamit for 2026.

asr-005232
03:46:24.680 --> 03:46:26.060
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Ganon ang ruling ng DBM.

asr-005233
03:46:26.900 --> 03:46:32.880
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yung absorptive capacity nyo, pag hindi nyo ginamit yun, magsak yung budget nyo for this time.

asr-005234
03:46:41.540 --> 03:46:46.320
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Sir, kasi kabababa lang po nung NCA na budget, kaya yun lang po ang naibigay sa amin.

asr-005235
03:46:46.800 --> 03:46:53.080
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: I'm asking, ilan na yung nagamit natin sa out of 1.532B for 2026?

asr-005236
03:46:54.300 --> 03:47:15.210
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi January to July, hindi natin alam yung mga ginagawa natin sa PTMP. That is the case, Mr. Chair.

asr-005237
03:47:15.210 --> 03:47:34.140
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: With the permission of Secretary, Mr. Chair.

asr-005238
03:47:35.480 --> 03:47:45.360
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Mr. Chair, yung pong budget for 2026, yun po yung sinasabi ni Secretary na ngayon pa lang po namin natanggap yung notice of cash allotment.

asr-005239
03:47:45.920 --> 03:47:55.780
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: So wala po kaming na-utilize dun sa 1.5 budget sa 2026 because the cash was only downloaded to us this week.

asr-005240
03:47:57.060 --> 03:47:58.740
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So zero utilization.

asr-005241
03:47:58.940 --> 03:48:03.380
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So zero utilization tayo on the PTMP. Anong nangyari, Mr. Chair?

asr-005242
03:48:03.620 --> 03:48:07.880
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So zero utilization tayo from January to July.

asr-005243
03:48:12.250 --> 03:48:19.650
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Meron po admin cost pero yung para sa equity subsidy po, we requested the budget as early as January.

asr-005244
03:48:20.530 --> 03:48:25.550
LTFRB Board Member Atty. Greg G. Pua Jr.: Pero yun po yung cash allotment na ibabalang po nito lang po.

asr-005245
03:48:26.230 --> 03:48:29.330
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Iba naman kasi yung budget sa equity subsidy eh than the PTMP.

asr-005246
03:48:34.570 --> 03:48:37.110
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So yung continuing budget yung equity?

asr-005247
03:48:37.790 --> 03:48:47.950
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dun sa 2020, Mr. Chair po, if I may answer po, yung equity subsidy po napapalo po yan sa PTMP po.

asr-005248
03:48:48.190 --> 03:48:51.670
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May equity subsidy, yan po kasama sa PTMP program.

asr-005249
03:48:52.250 --> 03:48:55.610
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Merong route rationalization, other activities kasama equity subsidy.

asr-005250
03:48:55.610 --> 03:49:03.470
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: When we submit budget, a chunk of it, I think when they submitted, 400 million ang kanilang equity subsidy that was given.

asr-005251
03:49:03.610 --> 03:49:04.550
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga, of course, for the 2026 project.

asr-005252
03:49:04.570 --> 03:49:09.130
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Then we have other subsidy po, yung fuel subsidy.

asr-005253
03:49:09.830 --> 03:49:16.570
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: That name itself, sa allotment, is fuel subsidy, which is a 2025, continuing for 2026.

asr-005254
03:49:17.610 --> 03:49:19.350
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Then we have a service contracting po.

asr-005255
03:49:19.810 --> 03:49:27.630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sinasabi po na kaya po mababa ang satingin natin ang utilization dito sa PTMP natin,

asr-005256
03:49:27.870 --> 03:49:34.030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sapagkat ngayon lang po nagkaroon talaga ng tamang program of work, at least for the 1.5 billion.

asr-005257
03:49:34.030 --> 03:49:34.110
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At least for the 1.5 billion.

asr-005258
03:49:34.570 --> 03:49:40.810
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ngayon lang po talaga kami humingi sa DBM ng NCA, at kami naman po ay pinigyan.

asr-005259
03:49:41.170 --> 03:49:47.910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero kapag yan po ay magiging sukatan kung bakit may utilization po natin, ay nasa kaligitnaan pa lang po tayo ng taon.

asr-005260
03:49:47.910 --> 03:49:56.130
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At makikita nyo naman po in the next few months na maubos po yan ng LTFRB pagdating po sa PTMP natin na 1.5.

asr-005261
03:49:56.210 --> 03:50:01.590
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi yan po ay pagbibigay po ng subsidiya dun sa mga ating modern transport groups po.

asr-005262
03:50:03.250 --> 03:50:03.910
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Okay, so...

asr-005263
03:50:04.570 --> 03:50:10.630
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: If that is the case, dahil sa ngayon, 176 million na lang yung budget natin.

asr-005264
03:50:10.730 --> 03:50:15.950
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So my question there is that, talagang ipursige ba talaga natin yung PTMP o hindi?

asr-005265
03:50:19.700 --> 03:50:22.260
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Anong gawin natin? Wala kayong budget?

asr-005266
03:50:22.620 --> 03:50:27.880
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Gaya po ng una kong statement kanina, Mr. Chair, itutuloy po natin ang PTMP.

asr-005267
03:50:28.560 --> 03:50:37.120
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Hindi naman po kailangang maghinto. Ngayon yung 176 million na i-grant sa amin kung yun lang po ang magbibigay for 2027.

asr-005268
03:50:37.740 --> 03:50:48.020
DOTr Assistant Secretary Dioscoro T. Reyes: Ipiprepare lang po namin yung ground para sa pagpapatuloy ng ibang programa ng mga, yung ibang component po na hindi natin napatupad.

asr-005269
03:50:48.660 --> 03:50:52.420
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi napansin ko dito, Mr. Chair, wala na kayong budget so far.

asr-005270
03:50:52.820 --> 03:51:01.040
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi tingnan ko dito, zero kayo sa equity subsidy, but then last time may around 1.5 billion tayo doon.

asr-005271
03:51:01.800 --> 03:51:07.340
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Fuel subsidy, 2.5 billion, pero naubos man yun. Now ngayon, zero. What is the plan?

asr-005272
03:51:07.740 --> 03:51:12.760
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Anong mangyari? Service contracting, dati may 1 billion tayo, ngayon, zero.

asr-005273
03:51:12.760 --> 03:51:22.280
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So my question again, balik doon, dahil sa out of 1.5 billion budget for 2026, ngayon, 176 million na lang.

asr-005274
03:51:23.100 --> 03:51:30.300
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: How are you going to continuously implement the program, itong PTMP, pag wala kayong budget?

asr-005275
03:51:30.980 --> 03:51:33.260
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Dahil, ito nga nakita natin, no?

asr-005276
03:51:33.260 --> 03:51:33.780
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: No?

asr-005277
03:51:33.780 --> 03:51:33.940
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: No?

asr-005278
03:51:33.940 --> 03:51:40.420
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: , hanggang ngayon, maraming transport co-ops or sa modernization, hindi sila nakaporsige.

asr-005279
03:51:40.820 --> 03:51:45.720
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yung iba dyan na, foreclosed na. At ito yung problema natin ngayon with your program.

asr-005280
03:51:45.960 --> 03:51:49.820
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So ang tanong, what will happen to our PTMP program?

asr-005281
03:51:49.820 --> 03:51:51.100
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Chairman, please wrap up your question.

asr-005282
03:51:52.320 --> 03:51:54.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May I just answer, Mr. Chair?

asr-005283
03:51:54.940 --> 03:51:59.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po, parati kong sinasabi kanina, kami nakikiusap, nabigyan kami ng pondo.

asr-005284
03:51:59.980 --> 03:52:06.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ang parati ko pong posisyon, mas kailangan natin ngayon na paigtingin yung ating modernization program.

asr-005285
03:52:07.240 --> 03:52:09.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nang kulang po ang ating pondo na nabigay sa NEP.

asr-005286
03:52:09.600 --> 03:52:18.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Just like last year po, ang NEP po natin, I think, sa PTMP, ay mga 1.2, pero tinaasan nyo po, plus 300 million.

asr-005287
03:52:19.000 --> 03:52:21.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung 300 million po, yan, is subject to SARO po ngayon.

asr-005288
03:52:22.120 --> 03:52:24.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya 1.2 pa lang yata yung nabigyan o 1 billion.

asr-005289
03:52:24.760 --> 03:52:25.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thereabout po.

asr-005290
03:52:25.500 --> 03:52:29.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon, ulitin ko po, matutuloy lang po yung modernization program.

asr-005291
03:52:30.300 --> 03:52:33.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Gaganda po yan kung tayo po ay may sapat na pondo.

asr-005292
03:52:34.220 --> 03:52:42.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kaya nga po, kami nakikiusap sa Kongreso na sana po, mabigyan kami ng sapat na pondo para po mas mapalawak natin yung modernization program natin.

asr-005293
03:52:43.220 --> 03:52:46.440
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Mr. Chair, for your intelligence, kwant lang ha? Puti na lang, no?

asr-005294
03:52:46.780 --> 03:52:50.500
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kaya nga, ako seryoso dito na magtanong dahil nakita ko yung trend, eh.

asr-005295
03:52:52.620 --> 03:52:58.900
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yung modernization natin ngayon, patuloy yung extension, walang hinto ang consolidation.

asr-005296
03:52:59.980 --> 03:53:09.040
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Sabihin, parang wala tayong klaro na direction kung paano natin tuldukan itong, kasi diba, part of the program is consolidation.

asr-005297
03:53:09.780 --> 03:53:12.160
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Pag hindi mag-consolidate, diba, wala.

asr-005298
03:53:12.860 --> 03:53:14.680
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi yun na ang direction ng ating program.

asr-005299
03:53:15.200 --> 03:53:18.960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Now, here come, nakita natin out from the budget, parang makikita mo yung trend.

asr-005300
03:53:19.420 --> 03:53:21.180
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: How serious are we with this program?

asr-005301
03:53:21.500 --> 03:53:28.520
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, tingnan mo, what are you going to do with the cooperatives na nag-invest na sa modernization, tapos yung iba hindi na magtuloy-tuloy?

asr-005302
03:53:28.680 --> 03:53:29.960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi, inayagan man natin.

asr-005303
03:53:29.960 --> 03:53:33.520
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi, inayagan man natin yung mga hindi nag-consolidate na mag-renew rin nyo.

asr-005304
03:53:33.860 --> 03:53:36.500
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Nakailang MC na tayo to renew the franchise?

asr-005305
03:53:37.180 --> 03:53:41.340
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Diba, three months, six months, hanggang ngayon, na-extend, na-extend.

asr-005306
03:53:41.720 --> 03:53:48.080
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Sabi ba daw, narinig ko ngayon, hanggang July 31 na nag-end na tayo.

asr-005307
03:53:48.200 --> 03:53:51.280
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, ang tanong dito, ilan ba ang nag-consolidate?

asr-005308
03:53:51.740 --> 03:53:58.160
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Dahil binigyan natin sila since 2024 until July 31, 2026, ng extension.

asr-005309
03:53:58.160 --> 03:54:04.900
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi, yung ibang transport operator, pag ayaw talaga mag-consolidate yun, kahit anong extend mo dun, hindi yan magko-consolidate.

asr-005310
03:54:05.760 --> 03:54:08.860
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: That's my proposition here.

asr-005311
03:54:09.260 --> 03:54:18.720
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, that's why, ang tanong ko dito, how serious are we na ituloy itong PTMP para mag-guide din kami dito sa house?

asr-005312
03:54:18.920 --> 03:54:26.400
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi, we will support this kung yung direksyon nyo is really to look for this program.

asr-005313
03:54:26.400 --> 03:54:28.120
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kasi, una-una, maganda naman.

asr-005314
03:54:28.160 --> 03:54:37.520
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Ito, niyakap ito ng mga transport group natin, nag-operativize sila, nag-corporation sila, but then, what happened right now?

asr-005315
03:54:37.960 --> 03:54:39.940
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Maraming na foreclose, anong rason dun?

asr-005316
03:54:40.420 --> 03:54:51.900
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Dahil, walang tigil ang pagtakbo ng ibang entity na hindi nag-consolidate kasi pwede naman pala sila magbiyahe na hindi rin pila sila nag-consolidated.

asr-005317
03:54:52.260 --> 03:54:55.600
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, again, wala tayong pundo for this program.

asr-005318
03:54:56.040 --> 03:54:57.360
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Damitin natin na rason yan.

asr-005319
03:54:58.160 --> 03:55:00.300
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Cannot continue anymore because we have no fund.

asr-005320
03:55:01.100 --> 03:55:01.240
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Okay?

asr-005321
03:55:01.640 --> 03:55:09.640
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, that's why, Mr. Chair, with this committee, we will get the commitment of our agency kung seryoso sa katuloy natin itong program.

asr-005322
03:55:09.640 --> 03:55:20.960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kung hindi, sabihan nyo kami na bayaran na lang yung nag-modernize na nag-utang para magkanya-kanya na at ibang programa ang gagawin natin.

asr-005323
03:55:21.760 --> 03:55:25.740
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: But then, if you are serious, I have a bill pending here.

asr-005324
03:55:26.280 --> 03:55:28.040
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Na i-institutionalize sana itong PTMP.

asr-005325
03:55:28.160 --> 03:55:34.480
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Pero kung hindi kayo seryoso dito, what's the use of this bill na ma-institutionalize itong ating PTMP?

asr-005326
03:55:35.200 --> 03:55:35.360
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Okay?

asr-005327
03:55:35.440 --> 03:55:40.980
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, that's why, related dito, Mr. Chair, sa budget, na pag wala kayong budget, hindi nyo tumatuloy.

asr-005328
03:55:41.640 --> 03:55:54.500
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, again, we will be getting you because the next manifestation I could have, of course, to provide with this committee na ibalik natin yung budget ng PTMP para magtuloy-tuloy tayo.

asr-005329
03:55:54.740 --> 03:55:58.140
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Pero pag sinabi nyo dito na wala na kayo magawa, hindi nyo tumatuloy.

asr-005330
03:55:58.160 --> 03:56:01.620
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kung hindi nyo na kaya, hindi sabihan nyo kami ng totoo.

asr-005331
03:56:02.080 --> 03:56:04.160
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: At ang tanong dito is, alam ba ng Presidente?

asr-005332
03:56:05.260 --> 03:56:07.340
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Pag sinabi natin na ayaw na nyo ituloy.

asr-005333
03:56:07.920 --> 03:56:17.320
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, yun lang, Mr. Chair, I will be getting the commitment of the DUTR family on this program kasi malaking dagok to sa transport sector natin.

asr-005334
03:56:17.500 --> 03:56:26.700
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Especially itong mga co-ops na nirepresentahan ko na nag-invest, niyakap yung program, gumastos, tapos ngayon, sumakit ulo nila.

asr-005335
03:56:26.700 --> 03:56:34.920
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Ang laki na ng utang, napu-foreclose na yung kanilang mga unit, natitingga na dahil wala kayong ginawang tamang proseso dito.

asr-005336
03:56:35.420 --> 03:56:37.800
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: May LTPRP pa tayo na issue.

asr-005337
03:56:38.320 --> 03:56:44.480
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yung malaki din sa gabal na kung tingnan natin yung figure right now, parang walang nangyari, walang improvement.

asr-005338
03:56:45.260 --> 03:56:46.760
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, walang budget.

asr-005339
03:56:47.480 --> 03:56:48.960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, how are you going to continue?

asr-005340
03:56:48.960 --> 03:56:51.500
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, again, Mr. Chair, ibalik ko.

asr-005341
03:56:51.840 --> 03:56:56.460
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Can I get the position of the DUTR on this program?

asr-005342
03:56:56.700 --> 03:57:03.640
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yun ba talaga-talaga ang totoong mandato na with your position right now, Sec, ituloy o hindi?

asr-005343
03:57:04.400 --> 03:57:09.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Opo, itutuloy po natin yung PTMP. Napakagandang konsepto po ng PTMP.

asr-005344
03:57:10.200 --> 03:57:14.940
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero admittedly po, ang problema is the implementation. Yun po yung kailangan naming ayusin.

asr-005345
03:57:15.260 --> 03:57:20.640
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Kaya nga, dahil yun nga, ulong-sulong kasi tayo sa gusto natin mangyari.

asr-005346
03:57:21.280 --> 03:57:25.640
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Imagine mo, 86% na nag-take rest, niyakap yung program, tapos...

asr-005347
03:57:26.700 --> 03:57:31.300
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Pa-extend na-extend tayo just to consider yung mga ilan na lang din.

asr-005348
03:57:31.800 --> 03:57:35.840
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, pag ganyan tayo, tingnan mo yung nangyari sa nag-consolidate ngayon,

asr-005349
03:57:36.000 --> 03:57:40.800
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: ayaw na nila ibigay yung kanilang PA para for the CPC or for the consolidation.

asr-005350
03:57:41.380 --> 03:57:44.620
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Dahil alam nila, i-can operate naman na magkanya-kanya pa rin.

asr-005351
03:57:44.620 --> 03:57:52.600
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, kung hindi nyo yan maayos, walang kwenta itong ating PTMP at we cannot move forward.

