asr-005821
04:17:02.480 --> 04:17:06.500
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: nagka-problema po yung drainage nung kanilang aircon ng train.

asr-005822
04:17:06.680 --> 04:17:12.260
