asr-005823
04:17:12.460 --> 04:17:15.940
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: At eventually, nung hindi na po gumagana yung drainage,

asr-005824
04:17:16.080 --> 04:17:20.900
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: tumapon po sa loob ng train yung tubig na nanggagaling po sa aircon.

asr-005825
04:17:20.900 --> 04:17:25.580
