asr-005878
04:21:52.390 --> 04:21:53.390
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-005879
04:21:57.640 --> 04:21:59.620
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you very much, Cong Renee Co.

asr-005880
04:22:00.200 --> 04:22:07.760
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Next to interpolate for the second round, and I hope this is the last, Representative Franz Pumaren.

asr-005881
04:22:08.180 --> 04:22:09.100
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Yes, thank you very much.

asr-005882
04:22:09.100 --> 04:22:10.860
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Actually, dapat hindi na ako magtatanong.

asr-005883
04:22:11.020 --> 04:22:13.460
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Pero nandito na rin si GM.

asr-005884
04:22:13.460 --> 04:22:14.760
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Sayang naman ang appearance niya.

asr-005885
04:22:15.260 --> 04:22:21.140
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Diba, kung hindi natin tatanungin, I know, kayang-kaya ni Sec. Banoy sagutin to.

asr-005886
04:22:21.740 --> 04:22:24.980
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Is this, there's still hope pa ba dun sa Bicol Express natin?

asr-005887
04:22:26.200 --> 04:22:31.280
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Because I know yung loan natin with China will be expiring this year.

asr-005888
04:22:31.520 --> 04:22:32.080
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Tama po ba?

asr-005889
04:22:33.280 --> 04:22:36.360
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: With the permission of Sec. Banoy and Mr. Chair.

asr-005890
04:22:37.840 --> 04:22:38.560
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Yes, sir.

asr-005891
04:22:38.880 --> 04:22:39.920
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: There's still a hope.

asr-005892
04:22:39.920 --> 04:22:42.960
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Actually, we're continuing yung rehabilitation pa rin.

asr-005893
04:22:43.460 --> 04:22:48.600
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Yung line natin, yung dadalawa lang pong tren na nag-ooperate ngayon.

asr-005894
04:22:48.780 --> 04:22:53.840
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Dito sa Lucena hanggang Calamba at saka sa Lupi, Camarines Sur hanggang Naga.

asr-005895
04:22:54.480 --> 04:22:57.620
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Yung Naga to Legazpi was damaged last year due to the typhoon.

asr-005896
04:22:58.120 --> 04:23:01.740
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: But we are restoring that with the budget that we have for 2026.

asr-005897
04:23:02.340 --> 04:23:08.460
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: What we need to complete the 422-kilometer line is the rehabilitation po ng mula Lucena, Quezon.

asr-005898
04:23:09.340 --> 04:23:11.580
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Idudugtong 'yun hanggang doon sa Lupi, Camarines Sur.

asr-005899
04:23:11.580 --> 04:23:13.440
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: And those are the things na sinasama po

asr-005900
04:23:13.460 --> 04:23:15.520
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: namin sa request ng budget sana.

asr-005901
04:23:16.160 --> 04:23:22.820
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Which we hope the Congress, through the support of course of our Department of Transportation,

asr-005902
04:23:23.400 --> 04:23:27.980
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: endorsing our request for additional budget para po sa capital outlay ng PNR po.

asr-005903
04:23:28.600 --> 04:23:31.320
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: You know, alam ko yung sinasabi nyo, always there's hope.

asr-005904
04:23:31.420 --> 04:23:34.400
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: But my main question ko dyan, is it worth the investment?

asr-005905
04:23:34.640 --> 04:23:40.180
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: When in fact, do you have data kung ilan sumasakay ng papuntang Bicol Express?

asr-005906
04:23:40.180 --> 04:23:43.140
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Because expiring na yung loan natin.

asr-005907
04:23:43.460 --> 04:23:44.460
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: That's about 6 billion.

asr-005908
04:23:44.740 --> 04:23:50.320
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Tapos, I guess you will be requesting Congress for additional funding.

asr-005909
04:23:50.800 --> 04:23:53.980
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Do you think yung marirecover pa ba natin yung investment dyan?

asr-005910
04:23:54.680 --> 04:23:56.700
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Do we have to look at the whole picture?

asr-005911
04:23:57.960 --> 04:24:05.980
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Mr. Chair, ngayon po sa kasalukuyan, honestly, we have only around 1,600 daily ridership.

asr-005912
04:24:06.400 --> 04:24:13.440
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: But with the migration of the trains na nung mga trains na nandito sa Manila na may migrate noong tumigil ang operasyon,

asr-005913
04:24:13.460 --> 04:24:22.520
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: sa Manila, at idadagdag sa operasyon, that passenger is expected po na tataas po kami ng mga around 5,000 to 6,000 daily.

asr-005914
04:24:23.100 --> 04:24:28.920
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: But with the additional trains po para sa Long Haul, I think, especially sa tourist destination pang Bicol,

asr-005915
04:24:29.020 --> 04:24:34.000
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: connecting the Region 4 to Region 5, that will increase more passenger po.

asr-005916
04:24:34.540 --> 04:24:39.540
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: At our expectation based doon sa study, initial study ng original alignment for South Long Haul,

asr-005917
04:24:39.540 --> 04:24:43.160
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: passing through the original PNR alignment,

asr-005918
04:24:43.460 --> 04:24:52.640
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: approximately around 20,000 to 25,000 daily ridership po ang pwede po mabigyan ng servisyo ng Philippine National Railway pa.

asr-005919
04:24:52.940 --> 04:24:58.080
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Okay, ganito lang, GM. You can give me all those data, but we want it in writing.

asr-005920
04:24:58.260 --> 04:25:07.140
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: So before we bring this to the plenary, if you can submit us all the data, justification, is it worth investing,

asr-005921
04:25:07.140 --> 04:25:11.080
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: is it worth pushing yung proyektong yan? Okay?

asr-005922
04:25:12.180 --> 04:25:13.140
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Mr. Chair, yes.

asr-005923
04:25:13.460 --> 04:25:18.540
PNR General Manager Deovanni S. Miranda: Yes, we will submit po, of course, in coordination to our Secretary Banay po.

asr-005924
04:25:18.960 --> 04:25:22.940
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Okay, next, yung paborito ko, Marina. Okay.

asr-005925
04:25:24.300 --> 04:25:29.220
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Kamusta yung Orient Register Classification? Suspended na ba yun? Blacklisted na ba yun?

asr-005926
