MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Mr. Chair, still suspended pa po under the preventive suspension.

asr-005927
04:25:35.640 --> 04:25:39.940
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: So, alam ko suspended. I'm just trying to ask your opinion. Blacklisted na ba yun?

asr-005928
04:25:39.940 --> 04:25:42.740
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Not yet po. So, meron pa pong...

asr-005929
04:25:43.460 --> 04:25:46.100
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Still, actually, nasa Office of the President.

asr-005930
04:25:46.360 --> 04:25:48.100
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: You know, sino may appeal? Sila?

asr-005931
04:25:48.300 --> 04:25:48.760
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Sila po.

asr-005932
04:25:49.140 --> 04:25:54.320
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: But who will give the recommendation? It's Marina, right? Hindi naman alam ng Presidente yan eh.

asr-005933
04:25:54.960 --> 04:25:59.860
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: So, ang point ko dito, why is this Orient Classification is so special?

asr-005934
04:26:00.340 --> 04:26:04.360
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Ilan palpak na to? Ilan na namatay na tao na hindi natin blacklist?

asr-005935
04:26:06.360 --> 04:26:08.260
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: It doesn't make sense.

asr-005936
04:26:09.380 --> 04:26:12.360
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Kaya siguro kahit kayo nag-a-appeal na mag-increase ng pondo,

asr-005937
04:26:13.460 --> 04:26:14.520
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: ako mismo nga haharang eh.

asr-005938
04:26:17.250 --> 04:26:19.770
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Give me a very good justification for that.

asr-005939
04:26:20.350 --> 04:26:25.410
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Ongoing na, sir. Actually, Mr. Chair, yung kanilang MR,

asr-005940
04:26:25.630 --> 04:26:30.410
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: nag-appel na po ng Marina. So, yung last, ano po, na appeal...

asr-005941
04:26:30.930 --> 04:26:35.750
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Ma'am, alam ko na po yan. Laging yan sinasabi nyo na kailang hearing na tayo.

asr-005942
04:26:36.590 --> 04:26:38.450
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Ilang buwan na yung may mga namatay.

asr-005943
04:26:39.050 --> 04:26:44.230
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Pero that I cannot understand. What's so special about that Classification Society?

asr-005944
04:26:44.230 --> 04:26:44.310
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Okay.

asr-005945
04:26:45.410 --> 04:26:48.830
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Ang dami ng palpak niya, puro suspension.

asr-005946
04:26:49.670 --> 04:26:51.810
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: 'Yun pag ganyan nga, bina-blacklist na 'yan eh.

asr-005947
04:26:52.270 --> 04:26:56.630
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Sa LTO nga, pag may nakasagasa and everything, tinatanggalan na ng lisensya kaagad 'yun eh.

asr-005948
04:26:57.410 --> 04:26:59.930
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: With this one, there's something special with that.

asr-005949
04:27:00.390 --> 04:27:02.290
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: With that Classification Society.

asr-005950
04:27:03.750 --> 04:27:05.990
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Ilan na yung Classification Society nyo na-accredited?

asr-005951
04:27:06.990 --> 04:27:11.670
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: We have three po na local, of course, including Orient.

asr-005952
04:27:11.670 --> 04:27:13.670
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: And we have seven international.

asr-005953
04:27:15.410 --> 04:27:16.990
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Members of the IACS.

asr-005954
04:27:17.050 --> 04:27:22.330
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Nag-a-admit ba kayo ng mga ibang gustong maging part ng Classification Society?

asr-005955
04:27:22.550 --> 04:27:29.350
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So far po, kinontinue ko lang po yung moratorium that was issued, I think, 2020.

asr-005956
04:27:30.350 --> 04:27:31.590
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: No, no, no. I understand that.

asr-005957
04:27:31.770 --> 04:27:35.430
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: But you should understand, hindi mo naman kailangan maging genius sa Marina.

asr-005958
04:27:35.770 --> 04:27:38.710
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: 6,000, 7,000 yung mga boats na ganyan.

asr-005959
04:27:39.470 --> 04:27:41.550
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Sa sampo lang yung nag-classify.

asr-005960
04:27:41.670 --> 04:27:44.790
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: How can they accommodate to classify that number of ships?

asr-005961
04:27:44.790 --> 04:27:48.830
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Bakit ayaw natin magpatanggap, magpasok ng bagong Classification Society?

asr-005962
04:27:49.330 --> 04:27:50.490
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Are we trying to control it?

asr-005963
04:27:50.690 --> 04:27:53.110
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Are we favoring certain Classification Society?

asr-005964
04:27:53.710 --> 04:27:54.630
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: It doesn't make sense.

asr-005965
04:27:57.020 --> 04:27:58.940
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Wala naman pong finifavor.

asr-005966
04:27:59.240 --> 04:28:07.340
