asr-005968
04:28:15.200 --> 04:28:15.420
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Okay.

asr-005969
04:28:16.200 --> 04:28:17.480
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: Tama yung sinasabi mo.

asr-005970
04:28:17.660 --> 04:28:20.000
Rep. Franz S. Pumaren: But you're looking at 6,000, 7,000 ships.

asr-005971
04:28:21.380 --> 04:28:27.060
